ont-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is scrutiny</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Corporate income tax:</strong> Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Value added tax:</strong> Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Withholding tax:</strong> Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Stamp tax:</strong> Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Tax health check:</strong> A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Tax calendar:</strong> One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>File</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</p><p><strong>When is the annual corporate tax return due?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 09:25:27.928');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmufc4zw20015ocvcq59z043i', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 6, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"<p class=\\"service-lead\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is scrutiny</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">How we help</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Corporate income tax:</strong> Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Value added tax:</strong> Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Withholding tax:</strong> Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Stamp tax:</strong> Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Tax health check:</strong> A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Tax calendar:</strong> One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Our approach</h2>\\n<ol class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Diagnose</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Correct</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">File</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Monitor</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></li></ol>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\">Who we advise</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Digital by design:</strong> Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Questions investors ask</h2>\\n<div class=\\"service-faq-list\\"><details class=\\"service-faq\\" open><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">When is the annual corporate tax return due?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Within four months of the financial year end. For a company with a 31 December year end, that means by 30 April.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">No. A company incorporated in Egypt is taxed on the same basis whoever owns it. What changes the tax position is the investment regime it operates under, such as a free zone or an economic zone.</p></details></div>\\n<p class=\\"service-closing\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</p>","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h1 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.08; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Direct &amp; Indirect Taxation</h1><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is scrutiny</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Corporate income tax:</strong> Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Value added tax:</strong> Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Withholding tax:</strong> Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Stamp tax:</strong> Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Tax health check:</strong> A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Tax calendar:</strong> One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>File</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</p><p><strong>When is the annual corporate tax return due?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.</p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["bodyEn"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 09:34:21.362');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmufjlb4k002cocvc1oz0xmbj', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 1, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","bodyEn":"<p class=\\"service-lead\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not assumed</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, royalties and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">How we help</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Double tax treaty relief:</strong> Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Permanent establishment risk:</strong> Review of how employees, agents, projects and contracts in Egypt are organised, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Cross-border payments:</strong> Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Inbound investment structuring:</strong> Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing mix and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Expatriate taxation:</strong> Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Our approach</h2>\\n<ol class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Map</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Chart the entities, transactions and payment flows involved.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Test</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant treaty and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Structure</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, substance and commercial needs.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Document</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance evidence and board records that support the position.</span></li></ol>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\">Who we advise</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Digital by design:</strong> Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Questions investors ask</h2>\\n<div class=\\"service-faq-list\\"><details class=\\"service-faq\\" open><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, interest and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Yes. A permanent establishment can arise through a dependent agent who concludes contracts in Egypt, or through construction or service projects that last beyond the period set in the relevant treaty.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">For covered treaties, it allows treaty benefits to be denied where obtaining them was one of the principal purposes of an arrangement.</p></details></div>\\n<p class=\\"service-closing\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</p>","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","shortDescriptionAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود."}}', '["bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 13:02:59.732');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmufjpo1g002focvcksgedmgs', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 7, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"<p class=\\"service-lead\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is scrutiny</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">How we help</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Corporate income tax:</strong> Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Value added tax:</strong> Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Withholding tax:</strong> Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Stamp tax:</strong> Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Tax health check:</strong> A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Tax calendar:</strong> One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Our approach</h2>\\n<ol class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Diagnose</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Correct</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">File</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Monitor</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></li></ol>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\">Who we advise</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Digital by design:</strong> Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Questions investors ask</h2>\\n<div class=\\"service-faq-list\\"><details class=\\"service-faq\\" open><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">When is the annual corporate tax return due?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Within four months of the financial year end. For a company with a 31 December year end, that means by 30 April.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">No. A company incorporated in Egypt is taxed on the same basis whoever owns it. What changes the tax position is the investment regime it operates under, such as a free zone or an economic zone.</p></details></div>\\n<p class=\\"service-closing\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</p>","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h1 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.08; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Direct &amp; Indirect Taxation</h1><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is scrutiny</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Corporate income tax:</strong> Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Value added tax:</strong> Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Withholding tax:</strong> Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Stamp tax:</strong> Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Tax health check:</strong> A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Tax calendar:</strong> One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>File</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</p><p><strong>When is the annual corporate tax return due?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.</p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 13:06:23.092');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmufkalz6002iocvcdm86q2fa', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 2, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","bodyEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","shortDescriptionAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p class=\\"service-lead\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not assumed</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, royalties and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">How we help</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Double tax treaty relief:</strong> Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Permanent establishment risk:</strong> Review of how employees, agents, projects and contracts in Egypt are organised, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Cross-border payments:</strong> Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Inbound investment structuring:</strong> Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing mix and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Expatriate taxation:</strong> Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Our approach</h2>\\n<ol class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Map</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Chart the entities, transactions and payment flows involved.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Test</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant treaty and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Structure</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, substance and commercial needs.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Document</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance evidence and board records that support the position.</span></li></ol>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\">Who we advise</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Digital by design:</strong> Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Questions investors ask</h2>\\n<div class=\\"service-faq-list\\"><details class=\\"service-faq\\" open><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, interest and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Yes. A permanent establishment can arise through a dependent agent who concludes contracts in Egypt, or through construction or service projects that last beyond the period set in the relevant treaty.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">For covered treaties, it allows treaty benefits to be denied where obtaining them was one of the principal purposes of an arrangement.</p></details></div>\\n<p class=\\"service-closing\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","image":"/uploads/1788250530647-wnvq6u5q.jpeg","imageId":"cmtie70bp000550vcofyfwio1"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 13:22:40.194');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuflzc7x00059kvcwanp6nrd', 'cmue38ep7000908vcqoqrbeix', 1, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"التسعير التحويلي","titleEn":"Transfer Pricing","bodyAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","bodyEn":"<p class=\\"service-lead\\">Intra-group pricing that stands up to inspection in Egypt and fits the group\'s global policy.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">A priority area for the Egyptian Tax Authority</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Egyptian law requires transactions between related parties to follow the arm\'s length principle under Article 30 of the Income Tax Law. Groups above the prescribed thresholds must prepare a master file, a local file and, where applicable, a country-by-country report.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">How we help</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Transfer pricing documentation:</strong> Preparation of the local file and support with the master file, in the required format and within the filing timeline.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Country-by-country reporting:</strong> Notifications and country-by-country reports for Egyptian parent companies and constituent entities.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Benchmarking studies:</strong> Selection of the most appropriate method, and searches for comparable companies and transactions.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Transfer pricing policies:</strong> Pricing policies for distribution, manufacturing, services, royalties and intra-group financing.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Inspection defence and advance rulings:</strong> Responses to transfer pricing inspections, and requests for advance tax rulings where certainty is needed.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Our approach</h2>\\n<ol class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Understand</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Interview management and analyse the functions, assets and risks of each entity.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Benchmark</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Select the method and test the pricing against comparable data.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Document</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Prepare files that tell a consistent story across the group.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Defend</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Support the position through inspection and, if needed, dispute.</span></li></ol>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\">Who we advise</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of multinational groups, Egyptian groups with foreign affiliates, and companies with significant transactions with shareholders or sister companies.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Digital by design:</strong> Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Questions investors ask</h2>\\n<div class=\\"service-faq-list\\"><details class=\\"service-faq\\" open><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Who must prepare transfer pricing documentation in Egypt?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Companies whose related-party transactions exceed the thresholds in the Executive Regulations must prepare a master file and a local file.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Are management fees paid to a parent company deductible?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Yes, provided the company can show that the services were actually received, that they benefited the Egyptian business, and that the charge is at arm\'s length.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">How often should a benchmarking study be updated?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Comparables should be reviewed regularly and refreshed whenever the business model, the group structure or market conditions change materially.</p></details></div>\\n<p class=\\"service-closing\\">Talk to us about your transfer pricing file.</p>","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":3,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","shortDescriptionAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص."}}', '["bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 14:09:53.565');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmufm01ng00079kvcybh0mv5h', 'cmue38ep7000908vcqoqrbeix', 2, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"التسعير التحويلي","titleEn":"Transfer Pricing","bodyAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","bodyEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":3,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","shortDescriptionAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h1 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.08; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Transfer Pricing</h1><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Intra-group pricing that stands up to inspection in Egypt and fits the group\'s global policy.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">A priority area for the Egyptian Tax Authority</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egyptian law requires transactions between related parties to follow the arm\'s length principle under Article 30 of the Income Tax Law and its Executive Regulations. Groups above the prescribed thresholds must prepare a master file, a local file and, where applicable, a country-by-country report.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Late or missing documentation carries penalties under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, and inspection adjustments can be significant because they often span several years. The Egyptian Transfer Pricing Guidelines follow the OECD Guidelines, but local practice on comparables and management fees has features of its own.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Transfer pricing documentation:</strong> Preparation of the local file and support with the master file, in the required format and within the filing timeline.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Country-by-country reporting:</strong> Notifications and country-by-country reports for Egyptian parent companies and constituent entities.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Benchmarking studies:</strong> Selection of the most appropriate method, and searches for comparable companies and transactions.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Transfer pricing policies:</strong> Pricing policies for distribution, manufacturing, services, royalties and intra-group financing, aligned with the group\'s value chain.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Management fees and intra-group services:</strong> Benefit evidence and cost allocation that support the deductibility of charges in Egypt.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Inspection defence and advance rulings:</strong> Responses to transfer pricing inspections, and requests for advance tax rulings where certainty is needed before a transaction.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Understand</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Interview management and analyse the functions, assets and risks of each entity.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Benchmark</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Select the method and test the pricing against comparable data.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Document</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Prepare files that tell a consistent story across the group.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Defend</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Support the position through inspection and, if needed, dispute.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of multinational groups, Egyptian groups with foreign affiliates, and companies with significant transactions with shareholders or sister companies.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>Who must prepare transfer pricing documentation in Egypt?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Companies whose related-party transactions exceed the thresholds in the Executive Regulations must prepare a master file and a local file, and groups above the country-by-country threshold must file a report. All taxpayers must disclose related-party transactions in their annual return.</p><p><strong>Are management fees paid to a parent company deductible?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>How often should a benchmarking study be updated?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Talk to us about your transfer pricing file.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 14:10:26.524');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmufm1dth000c9kvcemq8ijdd', 'cmue38eq6000a08vczid6w27k', 1, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"حل المنازعات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Dispute Resolution","bodyAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","bodyEn":"<p class=\\"service-lead\\">A disputed assessment is a negotiation with strict rules. We prepare for it from the first inspection request.</p>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\" style=\\"background:#081222;border:none;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;border-radius:6px\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\" style=\\"color:#fff\\">The settlement window closes on 31 December 2026</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\" style=\\"color:#C9D1DC\\">File a request under Law No. 79 of 2016 before the deadline to settle open disputes.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Most disputes are decided before the committee</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, a taxpayer who disagrees with an assessment must object within strict statutory deadlines. The outcome largely depends on the strength of the file at inspection: reconciliations, contracts, e-invoices and board records.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">How we help</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Inspection readiness:</strong> A review of your records and positions before the inspector arrives, so the file is complete and consistent.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Managing the inspection:</strong> Attendance at inspection meetings, responses to information requests, and challenge of adjustments that the evidence does not support.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Objections and internal committees:</strong> Technical memoranda and representation at the internal committee stage.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Appeal Committees:</strong> Preparation of the case, supporting evidence and representation before the Appeal Committees.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Settlement:</strong> Assessment of settlement options, including applications under Law No. 79 of 2016, extended to 31 December 2026.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Our approach</h2>\\n<ol class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Assess</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Review the assessment, the deadlines and the strength of each point.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Prepare</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Build the evidence file and the technical arguments.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Represent</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Present the case at each stage of the process.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Resolve</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Close the dispute through a decision or a negotiated settlement.</span></li></ol>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\">Who we advise</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\">Companies facing a tax inspection or an assessment they disagree with, and investors who have acquired a company with open disputes.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Digital by design:</strong> Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Questions investors ask</h2>\\n<div class=\\"service-faq-list\\"><details class=\\"service-faq\\" open><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">What happens if the objection deadline is missed?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">The assessment can become final and enforceable, which sharply limits the options that remain. Contact an adviser as soon as you receive a notice.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Is there a settlement scheme available now?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Yes. Law No. 79 of 2016 has been extended to 31 December 2026. A settlement request must be submitted by that date.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Is it better to settle or to appeal?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">It depends on the amount, the strength of the evidence and the cost of time. We give you a clear view of both routes before you decide.</p></details></div>\\n<p class=\\"service-closing\\">Received a tax assessment? Talk to us before the deadline runs.</p>","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":4,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","shortDescriptionAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية."}}', '["bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 14:11:28.949');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmufm3643000j9kvc0azex87l', 'cmue38eq6000a08vczid6w27k', 2, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"حل المنازعات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Dispute Resolution","bodyAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","bodyEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":4,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","shortDescriptionAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h1 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.08; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Tax Dispute Resolution</h1><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">A disputed assessment is a negotiation with strict rules. We prepare for it from the first inspection request.</p><p><a target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\" class=\\"text-brand-gold underline\\" href=\\"insight-dispute-settlement-deadline.html\\" style=\\"color: rgb(242, 244, 247); font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; margin-top: 8px; background: rgb(8, 18, 34); padding: 22px 26px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; text-decoration: none;\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>The settlement window closes on 31 December 2026</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(201, 209, 220); font-size: 15px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; line-height: 1.5;\\">File a request under Law No. 79 of 2016 before the deadline to settle open </span></a><a target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\" class=\\"text-brand-gold underline\\" href=\\"http://disputes.Read\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(201, 209, 220); font-size: 15px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; line-height: 1.5;\\">disputes.</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(212, 176, 106); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;\\"><strong>Read</strong></span></a><a target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\" class=\\"text-brand-gold underline\\" href=\\"insight-dispute-settlement-deadline.html\\" style=\\"color: rgb(242, 244, 247); font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; margin-top: 8px; background: rgb(8, 18, 34); padding: 22px 26px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; text-decoration: none;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(212, 176, 106); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;\\"><strong> the note</strong></span></a></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Most disputes are decided before the committee</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, a taxpayer who disagrees with an assessment must object within strict statutory deadlines. The dispute then moves through internal committees and Appeal Committees, and can reach the courts.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The outcome largely depends on the strength of the file at inspection: reconciliations, contracts, e-invoices and board records. A missed deadline can make an assessment final regardless of its merits.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Inspection readiness:</strong> A review of your records and positions before the inspector arrives, so the file is complete and consistent.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Managing the inspection:</strong> Attendance at inspection meetings, responses to information requests, and challenge of adjustments that the evidence does not support.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Objections and internal committees:</strong> Technical memoranda and representation at the internal committee stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Appeal Committees:</strong> Preparation of the case, supporting evidence and representation before the Appeal Committees.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Settlement:</strong> Assessment of settlement options, including applications under Law No. 79 of 2016, currently extended to 31 December 2026.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Litigation support:</strong> Technical tax support to legal counsel where a dispute proceeds to court.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Assess</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Review the assessment, the deadlines and the strength of each point.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Prepare</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Build the evidence file and the technical arguments.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Represent</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Present the case at each stage of the process.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Resolve</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Close the dispute through a decision or a negotiated settlement, whichever serves you better.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Companies facing a tax inspection or an assessment they disagree with, and investors who have acquired a company with open disputes.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>What happens if the objection deadline is missed?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">The assessment can become final and enforceable, which sharply limits the options that remain. Contact an adviser as soon as you receive a notice.</p><p><strong>Is there a settlement scheme available now?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>Is it better to settle or to appeal?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Received a tax assessment? Talk to us before the deadline runs.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-24 14:12:52.275');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmujhasnr001x7kvctsvyzxq0', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 8, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h1 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.08; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Direct &amp; Indirect Taxation</h1><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is scrutiny</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Corporate income tax:</strong> Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Value added tax:</strong> Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Withholding tax:</strong> Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Stamp tax:</strong> Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Tax health check:</strong> A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Tax calendar:</strong> One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>File</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</p><p><strong>When is the annual corporate tax return due?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788525161878-y6wtv0hy.jpeg","imageId":"cmtmxpb4v00027kvcqyav6yee"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-27 07:09:54.711');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmujiflho00207kvc6si4c3h8', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 9, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 183%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(8, 18, 34); font-size: 21pt; line-height: 183%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Direct &amp; Indirect Taxation</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 10pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is scrutiny</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Corporate income tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Value added tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Withholding tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Stamp tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Tax health check: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Tax calendar: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>File</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 7pt 0in 3pt; break-after: avoid; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0in;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 7pt 0in 3pt; break-after: avoid; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0in;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>When is the annual corporate tax return due?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">Within four months of the financial year end. For a company with a 31 December year end, that means by 30 April.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 7pt 0in 3pt; break-after: avoid; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0in;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">No. A company incorporated in Egypt is taxed on the same basis whoever owns it. What changes the tax position is the investment regime it operates under, such as a free zone or an economic zone.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(8, 18, 34); font-size: 13pt; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788525161878-y6wtv0hy.jpeg","imageId":"cmtmxpb4v00027kvcqyav6yee"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-27 07:41:38.316');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmujj45te0000hcvc0k4hywyp', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 10, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Our approach</span></p><p></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>File</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></p><p></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788525161878-y6wtv0hy.jpeg","imageId":"cmtmxpb4v00027kvcqyav6yee"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-27 08:00:44.402');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmukxvibk0006egvcvuw1jyd6', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 11, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h2>Direct</h2><h2>&amp; Indirect Taxation</h2><h2>Accurate returns, filed</h2><p>on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks</p><p>for it.</p><h2>Compliance is now digital, and so</h2><h2>is scrutiny</h2><h2>Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020,</h2><p>returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s</p><p>electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data</p><p>submitted by your customers and suppliers.</p><h2>Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the</h2><p>e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for</p><p>inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds</p><p>directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for</p><p>dividends.</p><h2>How we help</h2><h2>Corporate income tax: Preparation</h2><p>and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005,</p><p>computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions,</p><p>and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</p><h2>Value added tax: Registration,</h2><p>monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of</p><p>exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and</p><p>services.</p><h2>Withholding tax: Quarterly</h2><p>filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to</p><p>non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</p><h2>Stamp tax: Assessment</h2><p>of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable</p><p>instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</p><h2>Tax health check: A</h2><p>review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before</p><p>the Authority\'s inspection does.</p><h2>Tax calendar: One</h2><p>schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your</p><p>finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><ul class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><p><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Diagnose</span></p><p class=\\"service-step-body\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</p></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><p><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Correct</span></p><p class=\\"service-step-body\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</p></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><p><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">File</span></p><p class=\\"service-step-body\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</p></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><p><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Monitor</span></p><p class=\\"service-step-body\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you. Who we advise Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt. Why choose Sherif Yousry? Licensed accountants and advisers: Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market. International standards: We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority. International tax expertise: We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders. Partner-led, team-delivered: Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage. Digital by design: Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world. Questions investors ask What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt? The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime. When is the annual corporate tax return due? Within four months of the financial year end. For a company with a 31 December year end, that means by 30 April. Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies? No. A company incorporated in Egypt is taxed on the same basis whoever owns it. What changes the tax position is the investment regime it operates under, such as a free zone or an economic zone. Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</p></li></ul><p></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788525161878-y6wtv0hy.jpeg","imageId":"cmtmxpb4v00027kvcqyav6yee"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-28 07:41:41.121');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmul79sk6001v9kvcufeo6o5h', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 2, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","fullDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","fullDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","image":"/uploads/1788250530647-wnvq6u5q.jpeg","imageId":"cmtie70bp000550vcofyfwio1"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-28 12:04:44.118');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmul7b8ga00209kvc8ulmsuzj', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 3, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 183%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(8, 18, 34); font-size: 21pt; line-height: 183%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Tax Advisory</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Investors price uncertainty into every decision. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Our tax services</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","image":"/uploads/1788250530647-wnvq6u5q.jpeg","imageId":"cmtie70bp000550vcofyfwio1"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-28 12:05:51.371');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmul7dq6s00239kvcg597amjd', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 4, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Investors price uncertainty into every decision. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Our tax services</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788250530647-wnvq6u5q.jpeg","imageId":"cmtie70bp000550vcofyfwio1"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-09-28 12:07:47.668');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmutpc0le00265kvck3kpa13f', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 5, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Investors price uncertainty into every decision. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span><br><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Our tax services</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788250530647-wnvq6u5q.jpeg","imageId":"cmtie70bp000550vcofyfwio1"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-04 10:52:30.338');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmutpdy8i002a5kvc9p9htp7i', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 6, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%;\\">investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%;\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We provide local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Concession-based tax regimes, withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics, and distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgment, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>2 </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A meeting to understand your position, your </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and what you need to achieve.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>3 </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">fees,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>4 </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تحديد النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-04 10:54:00.594');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmutpjmj1002h5kvchcueu2ma', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 7, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، التسعير التحويلي، الضريبة الدولية، المنازعات الضريبية، الفوترة الإلكترونية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We provide local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Concession-based tax regimes, withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics, and distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors, and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender, or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing, and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgment, continuity, and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 1&nbsp;·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 2 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines, and what you need to achieve.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 3 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees, and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 4 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢ ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تحديد النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["bodyAr","bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-04 10:58:25.357');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv171ic002n5kvcppxjxsvq', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 8, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We provide local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Concession-based tax regimes, withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics, and distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors, and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender, or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing, and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgment, continuity, and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 1&nbsp;·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 2 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines, and what you need to achieve.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 3 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees, and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 4 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢ ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تحديد النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 09:12:19.812');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv1k1gc002q5kvcwgzb3fpt', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 12, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 183%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(8, 18, 34); font-size: 21pt; line-height: 183%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Direct &amp; Indirect Taxation</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 10pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is scrutiny</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, invoices and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 120%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the e-invoices and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Corporate income tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Value added tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, zero-rated and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Withholding tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Stamp tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking facilities and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Tax health check: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Tax calendar: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Review returns, accounting records and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>File</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 115%;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 7.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 116%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 116%;\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 3pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt;\\"></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 6.5pt; line-height: 115%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 13pt 0in 6pt; line-height: 133%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 7pt 0in 3pt; break-after: avoid; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0in;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 7pt 0in 3pt; break-after: avoid; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; padding: 0in;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>When is the annual corporate tax return due?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7.5pt; line-height: 118%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 118%;\\">Within four months of the financial year end. For a company with a 31 December year end, that means by 30 April.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مُقدَّمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788525161878-y6wtv0hy.jpeg","imageId":"cmtmxpb4v00027kvcqyav6yee"}}', '["bodyAr","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 09:22:26.268');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv1yb1l002s5kvcoh3k6b64', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 3, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","bodyEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","shortDescriptionAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h1 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.08; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">International Taxation</h1><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not assumed</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, royalties and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">At the same time, the Egyptian Tax Authority is looking more closely at foreign companies whose staff, agents or projects in Egypt may create a taxable permanent establishment.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Double tax treaty relief:</strong> Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Permanent establishment risk:</strong> Review of how employees, agents, projects and contracts in Egypt are organised, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Cross-border payments:</strong> Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Inbound investment structuring:</strong> Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing mix and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Foreign tax credits and residence:</strong> Relief for foreign tax paid by Egyptian residents, and advice on the tax residence of companies and individuals.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Expatriate taxation:</strong> Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Map</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Chart the entities, transactions and payment flows involved.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Test</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant treaty and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Structure</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, substance and commercial needs.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Document</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance evidence and board records that support the position.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, interest and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it. VAT on imported services may also apply.</p><p><strong>Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","image":"/uploads/1788250530647-wnvq6u5q.jpeg","imageId":"cmtie70bp000550vcofyfwio1"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 09:33:31.881');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv22bcz002y5kvch1156s7z', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 4, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","bodyEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","shortDescriptionAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>International Taxation</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">assumed.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">royalties,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">At the same time, the Egyptian Tax Authority is looking more closely at foreign companies whose staff, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">agents,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or projects in Egypt may create a taxable permanent establishment.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Double tax treaty relief: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Permanent establishment risk: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review of how employees, agents, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">projects,,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and contracts in Egypt are organized, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Cross-border payments: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inbound investment structuring: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">mix,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Foreign tax credits and residence: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Relief for foreign tax paid by Egyptian </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">residents and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> advice on the tax residence of companies and individuals.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Expatriate taxation: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Map</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Chart the entities, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">transactions,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and payment flows involved.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Test</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">treaty,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Structure</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">substance,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and commercial needs.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Document</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">evidence,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and board records that support the position.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">interest,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it. VAT on imported services may also apply.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. A permanent establishment can arise, for example, through a dependent agent who concludes contracts in Egypt, or through construction or service projects that last beyond the period set in the relevant treaty.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">For covered treaties, it allows treaty benefits to be denied where obtaining them was one of the principal purposes of an arrangement. Structures set up mainly for treaty access need to be reviewed.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضرائب</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدولية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">هياكل عابرة للحدود تتسم بالكفاءة على الورق وقابلة للدفاع عنها في الواقع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Noto Naskh Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">مزايا الاتفاقيات أصبحت تكتسب ولا تفترض</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">لدى مصر شبكة واسعة من اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي، وهي من الموقّعين على الأداة متعددة الأطراف لمنظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية التي تضيف اختبار الغرض الرئيسي إلى كثير منها. ولم يعد السعر المخفّض للخصم على توزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات وأتعاب الخدمات متاحاً إلا حين يتمتع الهيكل بجوهر اقتصادي حقيقي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">وفي الوقت نفسه، تدقّق مصلحة الضرائب المصرية بصورة أكبر في الشركات الأجنبية التي قد يُنشئ موظفوها أو وكلاؤها أو مشروعاتها في مصر منشأة دائمة خاضعة للضريبة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Noto Naskh Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مزايا اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">تحليل أحقية الاستفادة من الاتفاقية، وتوثيق الإقامة الضريبية والمالك المستفيد، والمطالبة بأسعار الخصم المخفّضة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة تنظيم الموظفين والوكلاء والمشروعات والعقود في مصر، واتخاذ خطوات عملية لإدارة خطر نشوء تواجد خاضع للضريبة غير مقصود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المدفوعات العابرة للحدود: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية لتوزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات والأتعاب الفنية والإدارية المدفوعة للخارج، بما في ذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هيكلة الاستثمار الوافد: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار دولة الشركة القابضة، ومزيج التمويل، ومسار إعادة الأرباح للاستثمارات الجديدة في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخصم الضريبي الأجنبي والإقامة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">تجنب الازدواج عن الضريبة الأجنبية التي يسددها المقيمون في مصر، والاستشارة بشأن الإقامة الضريبية للشركات والأفراد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضرائب العاملين الأجانب: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">الموقف الضريبي للموظفين الأجانب المنتدبين إلى مصر وللعاملين المصريين المنتدبين إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Noto Naskh Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرصد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">رسم خريطة للكيانات والمعاملات وتدفقات المدفوعات ذات الصلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاختبار</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم كل تدفق في ضوء القانون المصري والاتفاقية المعنية والأداة متعددة الأطراف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الهيكلة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">التوصية بالترتيب الذي يوازن بين التكلفة الضريبية والجوهر الاقتصادي والاحتياجات التجارية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التوثيق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">تجميع شهادات الإقامة وأدلة الجوهر الاقتصادي ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة الداعمة للموقف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">المجموعات متعددة الجنسيات المستثمرة في مصر، والشركات الأجنبية التي تخدم عملاء مصريين، والمجموعات المصرية المتوسّعة في الخليج وأفريقيا.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Noto Naskh Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Noto Naskh Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تخضع المدفوعات لمقدّمي الخدمات الأجانب للضريبة في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">تخضع مدفوعات كثيرة لغير المقيمين، منها الإتاوات والفوائد وطائفة من أتعاب الخدمات، لضريبة الخصم المصرية ما لم تخفّضها اتفاقية أو تُلغِها. وقد تُستحق كذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يمكن أن تكون لشركة أجنبية منشأة دائمة في مصر دون مكتب؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. قد تنشأ المنشأة الدائمة مثلاً من خلال وكيل تابع يبرم العقود في مصر، أو من خلال مشروعات إنشاءات أو خدمات تتجاوز مدتها المدة المحددة في الاتفاقية المعنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ما الذي تغيّره الأداة متعددة الأطراف؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">بالنسبة للاتفاقيات المشمولة، تجيز رفض مزايا الاتفاقية إذا كان الحصول عليها أحد الأغراض الرئيسية للترتيب. لذا يلزم مراجعة الهياكل المُنشأة أساساً للاستفادة من الاتفاقيات.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Noto Naskh Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">تحدّث معنا قبل تحويل أموالك عبر الحدود.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 09:36:38.915');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv24auc002z5kvccq3r86kv', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 5, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","bodyEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Treaty relief, permanent establishment risk and cross-border payments.","shortDescriptionAr":"الإعفاء بموجب المعاهدات، مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة، والمدفوعات العابرة للحدود.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>International Taxation</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">assumed.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">royalties,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">At the same time, the Egyptian Tax Authority is looking more closely at foreign companies whose staff, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">agents,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or projects in Egypt may create a taxable permanent establishment.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Double tax treaty relief: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Permanent establishment risk: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review of how employees, agents, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">projects,,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and contracts in Egypt are organized, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Cross-border payments: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inbound investment structuring: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">mix,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Foreign tax credits and residence: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Relief for foreign tax paid by Egyptian </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">residents and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> advice on the tax residence of companies and individuals.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Expatriate taxation: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Map</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Chart the entities, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">transactions,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and payment flows involved.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Test</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">treaty,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Structure</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">substance,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and commercial needs.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Document</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">evidence,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and board records that support the position.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">interest,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it. VAT on imported services may also apply.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. A permanent establishment can arise, for example, through a dependent agent who concludes contracts in Egypt, or through construction or service projects that last beyond the period set in the relevant treaty.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">For covered treaties, it allows treaty benefits to be denied where obtaining them was one of the principal purposes of an arrangement. Structures set up mainly for treaty access need to be reviewed.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضرائب</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدولية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">هياكل عابرة للحدود تتسم بالكفاءة على الورق وقابلة للدفاع عنها في الواقع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مزايا الاتفاقيات أصبحت تكتسب ولا تفترض.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لدى مصر شبكة واسعة من اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي، وهي من الموقّعين على الأداة متعددة الأطراف لمنظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية التي تضيف اختبار الغرض الرئيسي إلى كثير منها. ولم يعد السعر المخفّض للخصم على توزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات وأتعاب الخدمات متاحاً إلا حين يتمتع الهيكل بجوهر اقتصادي حقيقي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">وفي الوقت نفسه، تدقّق مصلحة الضرائب المصرية بصورة أكبر في الشركات الأجنبية التي قد يُنشئ موظفوها أو وكلاؤها أو مشروعاتها في مصر منشأة دائمة خاضعة للضريبة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مزايا اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحليل أحقية الاستفادة من الاتفاقية، وتوثيق الإقامة الضريبية والمالك المستفيد، والمطالبة بأسعار الخصم المخفّضة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة تنظيم الموظفين والوكلاء والمشروعات والعقود في مصر، واتخاذ خطوات عملية لإدارة خطر نشوء تواجد خاضع للضريبة غير مقصود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المدفوعات العابرة للحدود: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية لتوزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات والأتعاب الفنية والإدارية المدفوعة للخارج، بما في ذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هيكلة الاستثمار الوافد: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار دولة الشركة القابضة، ومزيج التمويل، ومسار إعادة الأرباح للاستثمارات الجديدة في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخصم الضريبي الأجنبي والإقامة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجنب الازدواج عن الضريبة الأجنبية التي يسددها المقيمون في مصر، والاستشارة بشأن الإقامة الضريبية للشركات والأفراد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضرائب العاملين الأجانب: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الموقف الضريبي للموظفين الأجانب المنتدبين إلى مصر وللعاملين المصريين المنتدبين إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرصد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">رسم خريطة للكيانات والمعاملات وتدفقات المدفوعات ذات الصلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاختبار</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم كل تدفق في ضوء القانون المصري والاتفاقية المعنية والأداة متعددة الأطراف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الهيكلة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التوصية بالترتيب الذي يوازن بين التكلفة الضريبية والجوهر الاقتصادي والاحتياجات التجارية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التوثيق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجميع شهادات الإقامة وأدلة الجوهر الاقتصادي ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة الداعمة للموقف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المجموعات متعددة الجنسيات المستثمرة في مصر، والشركات الأجنبية التي تخدم عملاء مصريين، والمجموعات المصرية المتوسّعة في الخليج وأفريقيا.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تخضع المدفوعات لمقدّمي الخدمات الأجانب للضريبة في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تخضع مدفوعات كثيرة لغير المقيمين، منها الإتاوات والفوائد وطائفة من أتعاب الخدمات، لضريبة الخصم المصرية ما لم تخفّضها اتفاقية أو تُلغِها. وقد تُستحق كذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يمكن أن تكون لشركة أجنبية منشأة دائمة في مصر دون مكتب؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. قد تنشأ المنشأة الدائمة مثلاً من خلال وكيل تابع يبرم العقود في مصر، أو من خلال مشروعات إنشاءات أو خدمات تتجاوز مدتها المدة المحددة في الاتفاقية المعنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ما الذي تغيّره الأداة متعددة الأطراف؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بالنسبة للاتفاقيات المشمولة، تجيز رفض مزايا الاتفاقية إذا كان الحصول عليها أحد الأغراض الرئيسية للترتيب. لذا يلزم مراجعة الهياكل المُنشأة أساساً للاستفادة من الاتفاقيات.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا قبل تحويل أموالك عبر الحدود.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["bodyAr","bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 09:38:11.556');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv257pi00305kvcvlweaa7a', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 6, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"استشارات اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والمنشأة الدائمة وضريبة الخصم على المدفوعات العابرة للحدود للمستثمرين الأجانب والمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات في مصر.","bodyEn":"Double tax treaties, permanent establishment, and cross-border withholding tax advice for foreign investors and multinational groups in Egypt.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Double tax treaties, permanent establishment, and cross-border withholding tax advice for foreign investors and multinational groups in Egypt.","shortDescriptionAr":"استشارات اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والمنشأة الدائمة وضريبة الخصم على المدفوعات العابرة للحدود للمستثمرين الأجانب والمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات في مصر.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>International Taxation</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">assumed.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">royalties,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">At the same time, the Egyptian Tax Authority is looking more closely at foreign companies whose staff, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">agents,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or projects in Egypt may create a taxable permanent establishment.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Double tax treaty relief: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Permanent establishment risk: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review of how employees, agents, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">projects,,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and contracts in Egypt are organized, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Cross-border payments: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inbound investment structuring: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">mix,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Foreign tax credits and residence: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Relief for foreign tax paid by Egyptian </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">residents and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> advice on the tax residence of companies and individuals.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Expatriate taxation: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Map</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Chart the entities, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">transactions,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and payment flows involved.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Test</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">treaty,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Structure</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">substance,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and commercial needs.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Document</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">evidence,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and board records that support the position.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">interest,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it. VAT on imported services may also apply.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. A permanent establishment can arise, for example, through a dependent agent who concludes contracts in Egypt, or through construction or service projects that last beyond the period set in the relevant treaty.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">For covered treaties, it allows treaty benefits to be denied where obtaining them was one of the principal purposes of an arrangement. Structures set up mainly for treaty access need to be reviewed.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضرائب</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدولية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">هياكل عابرة للحدود تتسم بالكفاءة على الورق وقابلة للدفاع عنها في الواقع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مزايا الاتفاقيات أصبحت تكتسب ولا تفترض.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لدى مصر شبكة واسعة من اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي، وهي من الموقّعين على الأداة متعددة الأطراف لمنظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية التي تضيف اختبار الغرض الرئيسي إلى كثير منها. ولم يعد السعر المخفّض للخصم على توزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات وأتعاب الخدمات متاحاً إلا حين يتمتع الهيكل بجوهر اقتصادي حقيقي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">وفي الوقت نفسه، تدقّق مصلحة الضرائب المصرية بصورة أكبر في الشركات الأجنبية التي قد يُنشئ موظفوها أو وكلاؤها أو مشروعاتها في مصر منشأة دائمة خاضعة للضريبة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مزايا اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحليل أحقية الاستفادة من الاتفاقية، وتوثيق الإقامة الضريبية والمالك المستفيد، والمطالبة بأسعار الخصم المخفّضة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة تنظيم الموظفين والوكلاء والمشروعات والعقود في مصر، واتخاذ خطوات عملية لإدارة خطر نشوء تواجد خاضع للضريبة غير مقصود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المدفوعات العابرة للحدود: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية لتوزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات والأتعاب الفنية والإدارية المدفوعة للخارج، بما في ذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هيكلة الاستثمار الوافد: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار دولة الشركة القابضة، ومزيج التمويل، ومسار إعادة الأرباح للاستثمارات الجديدة في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخصم الضريبي الأجنبي والإقامة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجنب الازدواج عن الضريبة الأجنبية التي يسددها المقيمون في مصر، والاستشارة بشأن الإقامة الضريبية للشركات والأفراد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضرائب العاملين الأجانب: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الموقف الضريبي للموظفين الأجانب المنتدبين إلى مصر وللعاملين المصريين المنتدبين إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرصد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">رسم خريطة للكيانات والمعاملات وتدفقات المدفوعات ذات الصلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاختبار</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم كل تدفق في ضوء القانون المصري والاتفاقية المعنية والأداة متعددة الأطراف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الهيكلة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التوصية بالترتيب الذي يوازن بين التكلفة الضريبية والجوهر الاقتصادي والاحتياجات التجارية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التوثيق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجميع شهادات الإقامة وأدلة الجوهر الاقتصادي ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة الداعمة للموقف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المجموعات متعددة الجنسيات المستثمرة في مصر، والشركات الأجنبية التي تخدم عملاء مصريين، والمجموعات المصرية المتوسّعة في الخليج وأفريقيا.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تخضع المدفوعات لمقدّمي الخدمات الأجانب للضريبة في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تخضع مدفوعات كثيرة لغير المقيمين، منها الإتاوات والفوائد وطائفة من أتعاب الخدمات، لضريبة الخصم المصرية ما لم تخفّضها اتفاقية أو تُلغِها. وقد تُستحق كذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يمكن أن تكون لشركة أجنبية منشأة دائمة في مصر دون مكتب؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. قد تنشأ المنشأة الدائمة مثلاً من خلال وكيل تابع يبرم العقود في مصر، أو من خلال مشروعات إنشاءات أو خدمات تتجاوز مدتها المدة المحددة في الاتفاقية المعنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ما الذي تغيّره الأداة متعددة الأطراف؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بالنسبة للاتفاقيات المشمولة، تجيز رفض مزايا الاتفاقية إذا كان الحصول عليها أحد الأغراض الرئيسية للترتيب. لذا يلزم مراجعة الهياكل المُنشأة أساساً للاستفادة من الاتفاقيات.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا قبل تحويل أموالك عبر الحدود.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 09:38:54.150');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv2b2iy00315kvcjqej6j4h', 'cmue38ep7000908vcqoqrbeix', 3, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"التسعير التحويلي","titleEn":"Transfer Pricing","bodyAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","bodyEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":3,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","shortDescriptionAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h1 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.08; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Transfer Pricing</h1><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Intra-group pricing that stands up to inspection in Egypt and fits the group\'s global policy.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">A priority area for the Egyptian Tax Authority</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egyptian law requires transactions between related parties to follow the arm\'s length principle under Article 30 of the Income Tax Law and its Executive Regulations. Groups above the prescribed thresholds must prepare a master file, a local file and, where applicable, a country-by-country report.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Late or missing documentation carries penalties under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, and inspection adjustments can be significant because they often span several years. The Egyptian Transfer Pricing Guidelines follow the OECD Guidelines, but local practice on comparables and management fees has features of its own.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Transfer pricing documentation:</strong> Preparation of the local file and support with the master file, in the required format and within the filing timeline.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Country-by-country reporting:</strong> Notifications and country-by-country reports for Egyptian parent companies and constituent entities.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Benchmarking studies:</strong> Selection of the most appropriate method, and searches for comparable companies and transactions.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Transfer pricing policies:</strong> Pricing policies for distribution, manufacturing, services, royalties and intra-group financing, aligned with the group\'s value chain.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Management fees and intra-group services:</strong> Benefit evidence and cost allocation that support the deductibility of charges in Egypt.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Inspection defence and advance rulings:</strong> Responses to transfer pricing inspections, and requests for advance tax rulings where certainty is needed before a transaction.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Understand</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Interview management and analyse the functions, assets and risks of each entity.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Benchmark</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Select the method and test the pricing against comparable data.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Document</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Prepare files that tell a consistent story across the group.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Defend</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Support the position through inspection and, if needed, dispute.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of multinational groups, Egyptian groups with foreign affiliates, and companies with significant transactions with shareholders or sister companies.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>Who must prepare transfer pricing documentation in Egypt?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">Companies whose related-party transactions exceed the thresholds in the Executive Regulations must prepare a master file and a local file, and groups above the country-by-country threshold must file a report. All taxpayers must disclose related-party transactions in their annual return.</p><p><strong>Are management fees paid to a parent company deductible?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>How often should a benchmarking study be updated?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Talk to us about your transfer pricing file.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788250530647-wnvq6u5q.jpeg","imageId":"cmtie70bp000550vcofyfwio1"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 09:43:27.371');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv51s8000325kvcguiwjka3', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 7, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"استشارات اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والمنشأة الدائمة وضريبة الخصم على المدفوعات العابرة للحدود للمستثمرين الأجانب والمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات في مصر.","bodyEn":"Double tax treaties, permanent establishment, and cross-border withholding tax advice for foreign investors and multinational groups in Egypt.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Double tax treaties, permanent establishment, and cross-border withholding tax advice for foreign investors and multinational groups in Egypt.","shortDescriptionAr":"استشارات اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والمنشأة الدائمة وضريبة الخصم على المدفوعات العابرة للحدود للمستثمرين الأجانب والمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات في مصر.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>International Taxation</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not assumed.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, royalties, and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">At the same time, the Egyptian Tax Authority is looking more closely at foreign companies whose staff, agents, or projects in Egypt may create a taxable permanent establishment.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Double tax treaty relief: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Permanent establishment risk: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review of how employees, agents, projects,, and contracts in Egypt are organized, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Cross-border payments: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inbound investment structuring: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing mix, and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Foreign tax credits and residence: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Relief for foreign tax paid by Egyptian residents and advice on the tax residence of companies and individuals.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Expatriate taxation: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Map</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Chart the entities, transactions, and payment flows involved.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Test</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant treaty, and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Structure</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, substance, and commercial needs.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Document</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance evidence, and board records that support the position.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors, and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender, or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing, and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity, and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, interest, and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it. VAT on imported services may also apply.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. A permanent establishment can arise, for example, through a dependent agent who concludes contracts in Egypt, or through construction or service projects that last beyond the period set in the relevant treaty.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">For covered treaties, it allows treaty benefits to be denied where obtaining them was one of the principal purposes of an arrangement. Structures set up mainly for treaty access need to be reviewed.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضرائب</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدولية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">هياكل عابرة للحدود تتسم بالكفاءة على الورق وقابلة للدفاع عنها في الواقع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مزايا الاتفاقيات أصبحت تكتسب ولا تفترض.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لدى مصر شبكة واسعة من اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي، وهي من الموقّعين على الأداة متعددة الأطراف لمنظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية التي تضيف اختبار الغرض الرئيسي إلى كثير منها. ولم يعد السعر المخفّض للخصم على توزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات وأتعاب الخدمات متاحاً إلا حين يتمتع الهيكل بجوهر اقتصادي حقيقي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">وفي الوقت نفسه، تدقّق مصلحة الضرائب المصرية بصورة أكبر في الشركات الأجنبية التي قد يُنشئ موظفوها أو وكلاؤها أو مشروعاتها في مصر منشأة دائمة خاضعة للضريبة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مزايا اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحليل أحقية الاستفادة من الاتفاقية، وتوثيق الإقامة الضريبية والمالك المستفيد، والمطالبة بأسعار الخصم المخفّضة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة تنظيم الموظفين والوكلاء والمشروعات والعقود في مصر، واتخاذ خطوات عملية لإدارة خطر نشوء تواجد خاضع للضريبة غير مقصود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المدفوعات العابرة للحدود: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية لتوزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات والأتعاب الفنية والإدارية المدفوعة للخارج، بما في ذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هيكلة الاستثمار الوافد: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار دولة الشركة القابضة، ومزيج التمويل، ومسار إعادة الأرباح للاستثمارات الجديدة في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخصم الضريبي الأجنبي والإقامة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجنب الازدواج عن الضريبة الأجنبية التي يسددها المقيمون في مصر، والاستشارة بشأن الإقامة الضريبية للشركات والأفراد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضرائب العاملين الأجانب: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الموقف الضريبي للموظفين الأجانب المنتدبين إلى مصر وللعاملين المصريين المنتدبين إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرصد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">رسم خريطة للكيانات والمعاملات وتدفقات المدفوعات ذات الصلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاختبار</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم كل تدفق في ضوء القانون المصري والاتفاقية المعنية والأداة متعددة الأطراف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الهيكلة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التوصية بالترتيب الذي يوازن بين التكلفة الضريبية والجوهر الاقتصادي والاحتياجات التجارية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤ ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التوثيق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجميع شهادات الإقامة وأدلة الجوهر الاقتصادي ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة الداعمة للموقف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المجموعات متعددة الجنسيات المستثمرة في مصر، والشركات الأجنبية التي تخدم عملاء مصريين، والمجموعات المصرية المتوسّعة في الخليج وأفريقيا.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تخضع المدفوعات لمقدّمي الخدمات الأجانب للضريبة في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تخضع مدفوعات كثيرة لغير المقيمين، منها الإتاوات والفوائد وطائفة من أتعاب الخدمات، لضريبة الخصم المصرية ما لم تخفّضها اتفاقية أو تُلغِها. وقد تُستحق كذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يمكن أن تكون لشركة أجنبية منشأة دائمة في مصر دون مكتب؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. قد تنشأ المنشأة الدائمة مثلاً من خلال وكيل تابع يبرم العقود في مصر، أو من خلال مشروعات إنشاءات أو خدمات تتجاوز مدتها المدة المحددة في الاتفاقية المعنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ما الذي تغيّره الأداة متعددة الأطراف؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بالنسبة للاتفاقيات المشمولة، تجيز رفض مزايا الاتفاقية إذا كان الحصول عليها أحد الأغراض الرئيسية للترتيب. لذا يلزم مراجعة الهياكل المُنشأة أساساً للاستفادة من الاتفاقيات.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا قبل تحويل أموالك عبر الحدود.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 11:00:12.960');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv56ed400335kvcixhdau78', 'cmue38eq6000a08vczid6w27k', 3, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"حل المنازعات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Dispute Resolution","bodyAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","bodyEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":4,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","shortDescriptionAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h1 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.08; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Tax Dispute Resolution</h1><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">A disputed assessment is a negotiation with strict rules. We prepare for it from the first inspection request.<br><br>Most disputes are decided before the committee</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, a taxpayer who disagrees with an assessment must object within strict statutory deadlines. The dispute then moves through internal committees and Appeal Committees, and can reach the courts.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The outcome largely depends on the strength of the file at inspection: reconciliations, contracts, e-invoices and board records. A missed deadline can make an assessment final regardless of its merits.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">How we help</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Inspection readiness:</strong> A review of your records and positions before the inspector arrives, so the file is complete and consistent.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Managing the inspection:</strong> Attendance at inspection meetings, responses to information requests, and challenge of adjustments that the evidence does not support.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Objections and internal committees:</strong> Technical memoranda and representation at the internal committee stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Appeal Committees:</strong> Preparation of the case, supporting evidence and representation before the Appeal Committees.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Settlement:</strong> Assessment of settlement options, including applications under Law No. 79 of 2016, currently extended to 31 December 2026.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Litigation support:</strong> Technical tax support to legal counsel where a dispute proceeds to court.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Our approach</h2><ol><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Assess</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Review the assessment, the deadlines and the strength of each point.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Prepare</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Build the evidence file and the technical arguments.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Represent</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Present the case at each stage of the process.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(122, 90, 30); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Resolve</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(62, 74, 91); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\\">Close the dispute through a decision or a negotiated settlement, whichever serves you better.</span></p></li></ol><p><span style=\\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\\">Companies facing a tax inspection or an assessment they disagree with, and investors who have acquired a company with open disputes.</span></p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"font-family: &quot;Hanken Grotesk&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 0px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 32px 0px 2px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; color: rgb(122, 90, 30);\\">Questions investors ask</h2><p><strong>What happens if the objection deadline is missed?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\">The assessment can become final and enforceable, which sharply limits the options that remain. Contact an adviser as soon as you receive a notice.</p><p><strong>Is there a settlement scheme available now?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p><strong>Is it better to settle or to appeal?</strong></p><p style=\\"margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(62, 74, 91);\\"></p><p style=\\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 28px 0px 0px; font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; color: rgb(8, 18, 34);\\">Received a tax assessment? Talk to us before the deadline runs.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p>الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.</p>","image":"/uploads/1788250530647-wnvq6u5q.jpeg","imageId":"cmtie70bp000550vcofyfwio1"}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 11:03:48.280');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv5jc5u00365kvcy6orzm2k', 'cmue38eq6000a08vczid6w27k', 4, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"حل المنازعات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Dispute Resolution","bodyAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","bodyEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":4,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","shortDescriptionAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Tax Dispute Resolution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">A disputed assessment is a negotiation with strict rules. We prepare for it from the first inspection request.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Most disputes are decided before the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">committee.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, a taxpayer who disagrees with an assessment must object within strict statutory deadlines. The dispute then moves through internal committees and </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">appeal committees</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and can reach the courts.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The outcome largely depends on the strength of the file at inspection: reconciliations, contracts, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">e-invoices,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and board records. A missed deadline can make an assessment final regardless of its merits.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inspection readiness: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A review of your records and positions before the inspector arrives, so the file is complete and consistent.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Managing the inspection: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Attendance at inspection meetings, responses to information requests, and </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">challenges</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> of adjustments that the evidence does not support.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Objections and internal committees: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Technical memoranda and representation at the internal committee stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Appeal Committees: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation of the case, supporting </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">evidence,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and representation before the Appeal Committees.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Settlement: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assessment of settlement options, including applications under Law No. 79 of 2016, currently extended to 31 December 2026.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Litigation support: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Technical tax support to legal counsel where a dispute proceeds to court.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Assess</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review the assessment, the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the strength of each point.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Prepare</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Build the evidence file and the technical arguments.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Represent</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Present the case at each stage of the process.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Resolve</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Close the dispute through a decision or a negotiated settlement, whichever serves you better.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Companies facing a tax inspection or an assessment they disagree with, and investors who have acquired a company with open disputes.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What happens if the objection deadline is missed?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The assessment can become final and enforceable, which sharply limits the options that remain. Contact an adviser as soon as you receive a notice.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Is there a settlement scheme available now?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. Law No. 79 of 2016 on the settlement of tax disputes has been extended to 31 December 2026. A settlement request must be submitted by that date; the case itself does not need to be closed by then.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Is it better to settle or to appeal?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">It depends on the amount, the strength of the evidence and the cost of time. We give you a clear view of both routes before you decide.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Received a tax assessment? Talk to us before the deadline runs.</span></p><p></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تسوية</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المنازعات</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الربط المتنازع عليه تفاوضٌ بقواعد صارمة. ونستعد له منذ أول طلب للفحص.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">معظم المنازعات تُحسم قبل اللجنة</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بموجب قانون الإجراءات الضريبية الموحد، على الممول الذي يعترض على الربط أن يطعن خلال مواعيد قانونية صارمة. ثم ينتقل النزاع إلى اللجان الداخلية ولجان الطعن، وقد يصل إلى القضاء.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تتوقف النتيجة إلى حد كبير على قوة الملف عند الفحص: المطابقات والعقود والفواتير الإلكترونية ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة. وقد يؤدي فوات ميعاد واحد إلى صيرورة الربط نهائياً بصرف النظر عن موضوعه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاستعداد للفحص: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة سجلاتك ومواقفك قبل وصول مأمور الفحص، ليكون الملف مكتملاً ومتسقاً.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>إدارة الفحص: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">حضور جلسات الفحص، والرد على طلبات المعلومات، والاعتراض على التعديلات التي لا تدعمها المستندات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطعون واللجان الداخلية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مذكرات فنية وتمثيل أمام اللجان الداخلية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>لجان الطعن: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد القضية والمستندات المؤيدة والتمثيل أمام لجان الطعن.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التسوية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم خيارات التسوية، بما في ذلك الطلبات وفق القانون رقم 79 لسنة 2016 الممتد حالياً حتى 31 ديسمبر 2026.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مساندة التقاضي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">دعم ضريبي فني للمستشار القانوني إذا وصل النزاع إلى المحكمة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقييم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة الربط والمواعيد ومدى قوة كل بند.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجهيز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد ملف المستندات والحجج الفنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التمثيل</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض القضية في كل مرحلة من مراحل النزاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الحسم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إنهاء النزاع بقرار أو بتسوية تفاوضية، أيهما يخدم مصلحتك أكثر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات التي تواجه فحصاً ضريبياً أو ربطاً تعترض عليه، والمستثمرون الذين استحوذوا على شركة لديها منازعات قائمة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ماذا يحدث إذا فات ميعاد الطعن؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">قد يصبح الربط نهائياً وواجب النفاذ، مما يضيّق الخيارات المتبقية بشدة. تواصل مع مستشار فور استلامك أي إخطار.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يوجد نظام للتسوية متاح حالياً؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. مُدّ العمل بالقانون رقم 79 لسنة 2016 بشأن إنهاء المنازعات الضريبية حتى 31 ديسمبر 2026. ويجب تقديم طلب التسوية بحلول هذا التاريخ، ولا يُشترط إنهاء النزاع ذاته بحلوله.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>أيهما أفضل: التسوية أم الطعن؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يتوقف ذلك على المبلغ وقوة المستندات وتكلفة الوقت. ونقدّم لك رؤية واضحة للمسارين قبل أن تقرر.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تسلمت ربطاً ضريبياً؟ تحدث معنا قبل فوات الميعاد.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 11:13:51.954');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuv6t5pb00395kvczcogwu87', 'cmue38eqy000b08vc2et29q5l', 1, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"العناية الضريبية الواجبة والهيكلة","titleEn":"Tax Due Diligence & Structuring","bodyAr":"الوضوح الضريبي قبل التوقيع، وهيكل مُخطَّط للخروج.","bodyEn":"<p class=\\"service-lead\\">Know the tax you are buying before you sign, and plan the tax you will pay on exit before you invest.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Tax exposures transfer with the shares</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">When you acquire shares in an Egyptian company, you inherit its open tax years, including any unpaid tax, penalties and late-payment charges. Tax findings are one of the most common reasons for price adjustments, specific indemnities and escrow arrangements.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">How we help</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Buy-side tax due diligence:</strong> Review of open tax years, inspection status, disputes and compliance quality, with each exposure quantified and ranked by risk.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Vendor tax due diligence:</strong> A tax review on the seller\'s side, so issues are resolved or disclosed before buyers find them.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Deal structuring:</strong> Share versus asset deals, capital gains on share transfers, stamp tax, VAT on asset transfers, and acquisition financing.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Market-entry structuring:</strong> Entity type, investment regime and incentives available under Investment Law No. 72 of 2017.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Our approach</h2>\\n<ol class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Scope</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Agree the areas, years and materiality that matter for the deal.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Review</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Examine returns, assessments, contracts and correspondence with the Authority.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Quantify</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Put a value and a likelihood on every exposure.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Protect</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Translate findings into price, warranties, indemnities or structure.</span></li></ol>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\">Who we advise</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\">Private equity funds, strategic acquirers, family offices and Egyptian owners preparing a business for sale or investment.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Digital by design:</strong> Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Questions investors ask</h2>\\n<div class=\\"service-faq-list\\"><details class=\\"service-faq\\" open><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">How long does a tax due diligence take?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Typically two to four weeks, depending on the number of open tax years, the quality of the records and access to management.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Are gains on the sale of shares in an Egyptian company taxed?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Yes. Gains on unlisted shares are generally taxable, including for non-resident sellers, subject to any treaty relief.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">What is the difference between buy-side and vendor due diligence?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Buy-side work protects the investor. Vendor work lets the seller find and fix issues first, which usually shortens the deal and supports the price.</p></details></div>\\n<p class=\\"service-closing\\">Planning an acquisition or an investment in Egypt? Talk to us before the term sheet.</p>","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":5,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Tax clarity before you sign, and a structure planned for exit.","shortDescriptionAr":"الوضوح الضريبي قبل التوقيع، وهيكل مُخطَّط للخروج."}}', '["titleAr","bodyAr","bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-05 11:49:29.759');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwit9zi000rx0vct63p054y', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 9, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 20px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We provide local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 20px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Concession-based tax regimes, withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics, and distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 20px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors, and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender, or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing, and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgment, continuity, and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 20px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 1&nbsp;·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 2 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines, and what you need to achieve.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 3 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees, and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 4 ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١ · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢ · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣ · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤ · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:13:16.878');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwiv05h000ux0vcrdfkpqt2', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 10, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><strong>Tax Advisory</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines and what you need to achieve</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاستشارات</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:14:37.445');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwiwo7b000xx0vcdmc1p5rg', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 11, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Tax Advisory</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines and what you need to achieve</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاستشارات</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:15:55.271');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwixxus0010x0vchuwxmism', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 12, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Tax Advisory</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines and what you need to achieve</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاستشارات</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:16:54.436');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwj1sz00015x0vcstn60ppf', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 13, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines and what you need to achieve</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:19:54.732');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwj4zra0016x0vcg9j80ssb', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 14, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Concession-based tax </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">regimes and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">tax,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the disposal of property</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and what you need to achieve</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:22:23.494');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwj6751001dx0vcx69z9iqx', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 15, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Concession-based tax </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">regimes and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">tax,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the disposal of property</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and what you need to achieve</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:23:19.717');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwj7vo1001ix0vcm8fcnisd', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 16, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Sectors we serve</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><h2 style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></h2><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Concession-based tax </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">regimes and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">tax,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the disposal of property</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and what you need to achieve</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:24:38.161');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwjgvcj001lx0vcy4oj4kal', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 13, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مقدمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مقدمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 183%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(8, 18, 34); font-size: 21pt; line-height: 183%; font-family: Cambria, serif;\\">Direct &amp; Indirect Taxation</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 183%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">scrutiny.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">invoices,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">e-invoices,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">• </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Corporate income tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Value added tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">zero-rated,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Withholding tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Stamp tax: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">facilities,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Tax health check: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Tax calendar: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>1 </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Review returns, accounting </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">records,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and e-invoice data for the open years.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>2 </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>File</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Step </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>4 </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">    </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgment, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>When is the annual corporate tax return due?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Within four months of the financial year end. For a company with a 31 December </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">year-end,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> that means by 30 April.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">No. A company incorporated in Egypt is taxed on the same </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">basis as</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"> whoever owns it. What changes the tax position is the investment regime it operates under, such as a free zone or an economic zone.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إقرارات دقيقة تُقدَّم في مواعيدها، مع توثيق كل موقف قبل أن تطلبه مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الالتزام أصبح رقمياً، وكذلك الرقابة</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بموجب قانون الإجراءات الضريبية الموحد رقم 206 لسنة 2020، تمر الإقرارات والفواتير والمدفوعات عبر المنظومات الإلكترونية لمصلحة الضرائب المصرية، وأصبح بإمكان المصلحة مطابقة إقراراتك مع البيانات التي يقدّمها عملاؤك وموردوك.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أصبحت الفروق البسيطة بين إقرار القيمة المضافة والفواتير الإلكترونية وإقرار ضريبة الشركات سبباً شائعاً لاختيار الشركة للفحص. وبالنسبة للشركات المملوكة لأجانب تكون المخاطر أعلى، إذ تنعكس التكلفة الضريبية مباشرة على النتائج المرفوعة للشركة الأم وعلى السيولة المتاحة لتوزيع الأرباح.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضريبة الدخل على الشركات: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد الإقرار السنوي وتقديمه وفق قانون الضريبة على الدخل رقم 91 لسنة 2005، وحساب الربح الخاضع للضريبة، ومراجعة التكاليف والمخصصات واجبة الخصم، والتخطيط للاستفادة من الخسائر المرحّلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضريبة القيمة المضافة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التسجيل، والإقرارات الشهرية وفق قانون الضريبة على القيمة المضافة رقم 67 لسنة 2016، واسترداد ضريبة المدخلات، ومعاملة التوريدات المعفاة والخاضعة لسعر الصفر والتصديرية، وضريبة الجدول على السلع والخدمات الواردة به.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضريبة الخصم والتحصيل: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">النماذج الربع سنوية وفق نظام الخصم والتحصيل تحت حساب الضريبة، والخصم على المدفوعات لغير المقيمين، مع مطابقات تدعم الأرصدة الدائنة التي تطالب بها.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضريبة الدمغة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">احتساب ضريبة الدمغة على العقود والإعلانات والتسهيلات المصرفية وغيرها من المحررات الخاضعة وفق قانون ضريبة الدمغة رقم 111 لسنة 1980.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الفحص الوقائي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة السنوات الضريبية المفتوحة لتحديد المخاطر ومعالجتها قبل أن يكتشفها فحص المصلحة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقويم الضريبي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">جدول موحّد لكل مواعيد الإقرارات والسداد، نتولى مسؤوليته ونشاركه مع فريقك المالي، فلا يعتمد شيء على الذاكرة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التشخيص</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة الإقرارات والسجلات المحاسبية وبيانات الفواتير الإلكترونية عن السنوات المفتوحة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التصحيح</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">سد الفجوات وتوثيق المواقف المتخذة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تقديم الإقرارات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد الإقرارات وتقديمها خلال المواعيد القانونية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المتابعة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">متابعة تغيّرات التشريع وممارسات مصلحة الضرائب، وشرح أثر كل منها عليك.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات المصرية التابعة لمجموعات أجنبية، والشركات العائلية والمدعومة من مستثمرين، والمستثمرون الأجانب في سنوات عملهم الأولى في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ما سعر ضريبة الدخل على الشركات في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">السعر العام 22.5% من الربح الخاضع للضريبة. وتُطبَّق أسعار مختلفة على بعض الجهات، مثل شركات البحث عن البترول وإنتاجه، وقد تستفيد المشروعات الأصغر من النظام الضريبي المبسّط.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>متى يُستحق تقديم الإقرار الضريبي السنوي للشركات؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">خلال أربعة أشهر من انتهاء السنة المالية. أي بحلول 30 أبريل للشركة التي تنتهي سنتها المالية في 31 ديسمبر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تخضع الشركات المملوكة لأجانب لمعاملة ضريبية مختلفة عن الشركات المصرية؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لا. تخضع الشركة المؤسسة في مصر للضريبة على الأساس ذاته أياً كان مالكها. ما يغيّر الموقف الضريبي هو نظام الاستثمار الذي تعمل في ظله، كالمنطقة الحرة أو المنطقة الاقتصادية.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا عن موقفك من ضريبة الشركات والقيمة المضافة.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:31:37.651');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwjiqws001mx0vck5pe6g1r', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 8, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"استشارات اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والمنشأة الدائمة وضريبة الخصم على المدفوعات العابرة للحدود للمستثمرين الأجانب والمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات في مصر.","bodyEn":"Double tax treaties, permanent establishment, and cross-border withholding tax advice for foreign investors and multinational groups in Egypt.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Double tax treaties, permanent establishment, and cross-border withholding tax advice for foreign investors and multinational groups in Egypt.","shortDescriptionAr":"استشارات اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والمنشأة الدائمة وضريبة الخصم على المدفوعات العابرة للحدود للمستثمرين الأجانب والمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات في مصر.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>International Taxation</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not assumed.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, royalties, and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">At the same time, the Egyptian Tax Authority is looking more closely at foreign companies whose staff, agents, or projects in Egypt may create a taxable permanent establishment.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Double tax treaty relief: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Permanent establishment risk: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review of how employees, agents, projects,, and contracts in Egypt are organized, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Cross-border payments: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inbound investment structuring: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing mix, and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Foreign tax credits and residence: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Relief for foreign tax paid by Egyptian residents and advice on the tax residence of companies and individuals.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Expatriate taxation: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Map</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Chart the entities, transactions, and payment flows involved.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Test</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant treaty, and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Structure</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, substance, and commercial needs.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Document</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance evidence, and board records that support the position.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors, and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender, or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing, and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity, and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, interest, and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it. VAT on imported services may also apply.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. A permanent establishment can arise, for example, through a dependent agent who concludes contracts in Egypt, or through construction or service projects that last beyond the period set in the relevant treaty.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">For covered treaties, it allows treaty benefits to be denied where obtaining them was one of the principal purposes of an arrangement. Structures set up mainly for treaty access need to be reviewed.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضرائب</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدولية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">هياكل عابرة للحدود تتسم بالكفاءة على الورق وقابلة للدفاع عنها في الواقع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مزايا الاتفاقيات أصبحت تكتسب ولا تفترض.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لدى مصر شبكة واسعة من اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي، وهي من الموقّعين على الأداة متعددة الأطراف لمنظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية التي تضيف اختبار الغرض الرئيسي إلى كثير منها. ولم يعد السعر المخفّض للخصم على توزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات وأتعاب الخدمات متاحاً إلا حين يتمتع الهيكل بجوهر اقتصادي حقيقي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">وفي الوقت نفسه، تدقّق مصلحة الضرائب المصرية بصورة أكبر في الشركات الأجنبية التي قد يُنشئ موظفوها أو وكلاؤها أو مشروعاتها في مصر منشأة دائمة خاضعة للضريبة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مزايا اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحليل أحقية الاستفادة من الاتفاقية، وتوثيق الإقامة الضريبية والمالك المستفيد، والمطالبة بأسعار الخصم المخفّضة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة تنظيم الموظفين والوكلاء والمشروعات والعقود في مصر، واتخاذ خطوات عملية لإدارة خطر نشوء تواجد خاضع للضريبة غير مقصود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المدفوعات العابرة للحدود: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية لتوزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات والأتعاب الفنية والإدارية المدفوعة للخارج، بما في ذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هيكلة الاستثمار الوافد: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار دولة الشركة القابضة، ومزيج التمويل، ومسار إعادة الأرباح للاستثمارات الجديدة في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخصم الضريبي الأجنبي والإقامة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجنب الازدواج عن الضريبة الأجنبية التي يسددها المقيمون في مصر، والاستشارة بشأن الإقامة الضريبية للشركات والأفراد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضرائب العاملين الأجانب: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الموقف الضريبي للموظفين الأجانب المنتدبين إلى مصر وللعاملين المصريين المنتدبين إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرصد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">رسم خريطة للكيانات والمعاملات وتدفقات المدفوعات ذات الصلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاختبار</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم كل تدفق في ضوء القانون المصري والاتفاقية المعنية والأداة متعددة الأطراف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الهيكلة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التوصية بالترتيب الذي يوازن بين التكلفة الضريبية والجوهر الاقتصادي والاحتياجات التجارية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤ ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التوثيق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجميع شهادات الإقامة وأدلة الجوهر الاقتصادي ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة الداعمة للموقف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المجموعات متعددة الجنسيات المستثمرة في مصر، والشركات الأجنبية التي تخدم عملاء مصريين، والمجموعات المصرية المتوسّعة في الخليج وأفريقيا.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تخضع المدفوعات لمقدّمي الخدمات الأجانب للضريبة في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تخضع مدفوعات كثيرة لغير المقيمين، منها الإتاوات والفوائد وطائفة من أتعاب الخدمات، لضريبة الخصم المصرية ما لم تخفّضها اتفاقية أو تُلغِها. وقد تُستحق كذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يمكن أن تكون لشركة أجنبية منشأة دائمة في مصر دون مكتب؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. قد تنشأ المنشأة الدائمة مثلاً من خلال وكيل تابع يبرم العقود في مصر، أو من خلال مشروعات إنشاءات أو خدمات تتجاوز مدتها المدة المحددة في الاتفاقية المعنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ما الذي تغيّره الأداة متعددة الأطراف؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بالنسبة للاتفاقيات المشمولة، تجيز رفض مزايا الاتفاقية إذا كان الحصول عليها أحد الأغراض الرئيسية للترتيب. لذا يلزم مراجعة الهياكل المُنشأة أساساً للاستفادة من الاتفاقيات.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا قبل تحويل أموالك عبر الحدود.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:33:05.212');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwjko2n001nx0vcar1clcs0', 'cmue38eo7000808vcukpur529', 9, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب الدولية","titleEn":"International Taxation","bodyAr":"استشارات اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والمنشأة الدائمة وضريبة الخصم على المدفوعات العابرة للحدود للمستثمرين الأجانب والمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات في مصر.","bodyEn":"Double tax treaties, permanent establishment, and cross-border withholding tax advice for foreign investors and multinational groups in Egypt.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":2,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Double tax treaties, permanent establishment, and cross-border withholding tax advice for foreign investors and multinational groups in Egypt.","shortDescriptionAr":"استشارات اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والمنشأة الدائمة وضريبة الخصم على المدفوعات العابرة للحدود للمستثمرين الأجانب والمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات في مصر.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>International Taxation</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Cross-border structures that are efficient on paper and defensible in practice.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Treaty benefits must now be earned, not </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">assumed.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egypt has an extensive network of double tax treaties and is a signatory to the OECD Multilateral Instrument, which adds a principal purpose test to many of them. Reduced withholding on dividends, interest, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">royalties,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and service fees is now available only where a structure has genuine substance.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">At the same time, the Egyptian Tax Authority is looking more closely at foreign companies whose staff, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">agents,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or projects in Egypt may create a taxable permanent establishment.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Double tax treaty relief: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Analysis of treaty eligibility, documentation of tax residence and beneficial ownership, and claims for reduced withholding rates.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Permanent establishment risk: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review of how employees, agents, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">projects,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and contracts in Egypt are organised, and practical steps to manage the risk of an unintended taxable presence.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Cross-border payments: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of dividends, interest, royalties, and technical and management fees paid abroad, including VAT on imported services.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inbound investment structuring: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Choice of holding jurisdiction, financing </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">mix,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and profit repatriation route for new investment in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Foreign tax credits and residence: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Relief for foreign tax paid by Egyptian </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">residents and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> advice on the tax residence of companies and individuals.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Expatriate taxation: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax position of foreign employees assigned to Egypt and of Egyptian staff seconded abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Map</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Chart the entities, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">transactions,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and payment flows involved.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Test</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assess each flow against Egyptian law, the relevant </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">treaty,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the Multilateral Instrument.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Structure</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recommend the arrangement that balances tax cost, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">substance,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and commercial needs.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Document</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assemble residence certificates, substance </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">evidence,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and board records that support the position.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Multinational groups investing in Egypt, foreign companies serving Egyptian customers, and Egyptian groups expanding into the Gulf and Africa.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Does Egypt tax payments to foreign service providers?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Many payments to non-residents, including royalties, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">interest,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and a range of service fees, are subject to Egyptian withholding tax unless a treaty reduces or removes it. VAT on imported services may also apply.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Can a foreign company have a permanent establishment in Egypt without an office?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. A permanent establishment can arise, for example, through a dependent agent who concludes contracts in Egypt, or through construction or service projects that last beyond the period set in the relevant treaty.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What does the Multilateral Instrument change?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">For covered treaties, it allows treaty benefits to be denied where obtaining them was one of the principal purposes of an arrangement. Structures set up mainly for treaty access need to be reviewed.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us before you move money across borders.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضرائب</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدولية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">هياكل عابرة للحدود تتسم بالكفاءة على الورق وقابلة للدفاع عنها في الواقع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مزايا الاتفاقيات أصبحت تكتسب ولا تفترض.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لدى مصر شبكة واسعة من اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي، وهي من الموقّعين على الأداة متعددة الأطراف لمنظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية التي تضيف اختبار الغرض الرئيسي إلى كثير منها. ولم يعد السعر المخفّض للخصم على توزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات وأتعاب الخدمات متاحاً إلا حين يتمتع الهيكل بجوهر اقتصادي حقيقي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">وفي الوقت نفسه، تدقّق مصلحة الضرائب المصرية بصورة أكبر في الشركات الأجنبية التي قد يُنشئ موظفوها أو وكلاؤها أو مشروعاتها في مصر منشأة دائمة خاضعة للضريبة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مزايا اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحليل أحقية الاستفادة من الاتفاقية، وتوثيق الإقامة الضريبية والمالك المستفيد، والمطالبة بأسعار الخصم المخفّضة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مخاطر المنشأة الدائمة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة تنظيم الموظفين والوكلاء والمشروعات والعقود في مصر، واتخاذ خطوات عملية لإدارة خطر نشوء تواجد خاضع للضريبة غير مقصود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المدفوعات العابرة للحدود: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية لتوزيعات الأرباح والفوائد والإتاوات والأتعاب الفنية والإدارية المدفوعة للخارج، بما في ذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هيكلة الاستثمار الوافد: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار دولة الشركة القابضة، ومزيج التمويل، ومسار إعادة الأرباح للاستثمارات الجديدة في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخصم الضريبي الأجنبي والإقامة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجنب الازدواج عن الضريبة الأجنبية التي يسددها المقيمون في مصر، والاستشارة بشأن الإقامة الضريبية للشركات والأفراد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضرائب العاملين الأجانب: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الموقف الضريبي للموظفين الأجانب المنتدبين إلى مصر وللعاملين المصريين المنتدبين إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرصد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">رسم خريطة للكيانات والمعاملات وتدفقات المدفوعات ذات الصلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاختبار</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم كل تدفق في ضوء القانون المصري والاتفاقية المعنية والأداة متعددة الأطراف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الهيكلة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التوصية بالترتيب الذي يوازن بين التكلفة الضريبية والجوهر الاقتصادي والاحتياجات التجارية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤ ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التوثيق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجميع شهادات الإقامة وأدلة الجوهر الاقتصادي ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة الداعمة للموقف.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المجموعات متعددة الجنسيات المستثمرة في مصر، والشركات الأجنبية التي تخدم عملاء مصريين، والمجموعات المصرية المتوسّعة في الخليج وأفريقيا.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تخضع المدفوعات لمقدّمي الخدمات الأجانب للضريبة في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تخضع مدفوعات كثيرة لغير المقيمين، منها الإتاوات والفوائد وطائفة من أتعاب الخدمات، لضريبة الخصم المصرية ما لم تخفّضها اتفاقية أو تُلغِها. وقد تُستحق كذلك ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات المستوردة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يمكن أن تكون لشركة أجنبية منشأة دائمة في مصر دون مكتب؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. قد تنشأ المنشأة الدائمة مثلاً من خلال وكيل تابع يبرم العقود في مصر، أو من خلال مشروعات إنشاءات أو خدمات تتجاوز مدتها المدة المحددة في الاتفاقية المعنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ما الذي تغيّره الأداة متعددة الأطراف؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بالنسبة للاتفاقيات المشمولة، تجيز رفض مزايا الاتفاقية إذا كان الحصول عليها أحد الأغراض الرئيسية للترتيب. لذا يلزم مراجعة الهياكل المُنشأة أساساً للاستفادة من الاتفاقيات.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا قبل تحويل أموالك عبر الحدود.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:34:34.847');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwjnaye001ox0vcqof1dmzs', 'cmue38ep7000908vcqoqrbeix', 4, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"التسعير التحويلي","titleEn":"Transfer Pricing","bodyAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","bodyEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":3,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","shortDescriptionAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Transfer Pricing</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Intra-group pricing that stands up to inspection in Egypt and fits the group\'s global policy.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">A priority area for the Egyptian Tax Authority</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egyptian law requires transactions between related parties to follow the arm\'s length principle under Article 30 of the Income Tax Law and its Executive Regulations. Groups above the prescribed thresholds must prepare a master file, a local </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">file,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and, where applicable, a country-by-country report.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Late or missing documentation carries penalties under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, and inspection adjustments can be significant because they often span several years. The Egyptian Transfer Pricing Guidelines follow the OECD Guidelines, but local practice on comparables and management fees has features of its own.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Transfer pricing documentation: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation of the local file and support with the master file, in the required format and within the filing timeline.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Country-by-country reporting: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Notifications and country-by-country reports for Egyptian parent companies and constituent entities.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Benchmarking studies: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Selection of the most appropriate </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">method and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> searches for comparable companies and transactions.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Transfer pricing policies: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Pricing policies for distribution, manufacturing, services, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">royalties,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and intra-group financing, aligned with the group\'s value chain.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Management fees and intra-group services: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Benefit evidence and cost allocation that support the deductibility of charges in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inspection </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>defense</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong> and advance rulings: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Responses to transfer pricing </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">inspections and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> requests for advance tax rulings where certainty is needed before a transaction.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Understand</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Interview management and analyse the functions, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">assets,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and risks of each entity.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Benchmark</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Select the method and test the pricing against comparable data.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Document</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Prepare files that tell a consistent story across the group.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Defend</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Support the position through inspection and, if needed, dispute.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of multinational groups, Egyptian groups with foreign affiliates, and companies with significant transactions with shareholders or sister companies.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who must prepare transfer pricing documentation in Egypt?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Companies whose related-party transactions exceed the thresholds in the Executive Regulations must prepare a master file and a local file, and groups above the country-by-country threshold must file a report. All taxpayers must disclose related-party transactions in their annual return.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Are management fees paid to a parent company deductible?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes, provided the company can show that the services were actually received, that they benefited the Egyptian business, and that the charge is at arm\'s length.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>How often should a benchmarking study be updated?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Comparables should be reviewed regularly and refreshed whenever the business model, the group </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">structure,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or market conditions change materially.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us about your transfer pricing file.</span></p><p></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التسعير التحويلي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تسعير داخل المجموعة يصمد أمام الفحص في مصر ويتسق مع السياسة العالمية للمجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أولوية لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُلزم القانون المصري بأن تتم المعاملات بين الأطراف المرتبطة وفق مبدأ السعر المحايد طبقاً للمادة 30 من قانون الضريبة على الدخل ولائحته التنفيذية. وعلى المجموعات التي تتجاوز الحدود المقررة إعداد ملف رئيسي وملف محلي، وتقرير على مستوى كل دولة على حدة متى انطبق ذلك.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يترتب على تأخر التوثيق أو غيابه غرامات وفق قانون الإجراءات الضريبية الموحد، وقد تكون تعديلات الفحص كبيرة لأنها كثيراً ما تمتد إلى عدة سنوات. وتتبع الإرشادات المصرية للتسعير التحويلي إرشادات منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، إلا أن للممارسة المحلية خصوصيتها في المقارنات والأتعاب الإدارية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>توثيق التسعير التحويلي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد الملف المحلي والمساندة في الملف الرئيسي، بالشكل المطلوب وضمن الجدول الزمني للتقديم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقارير على مستوى كل دولة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الإخطارات والتقارير على مستوى كل دولة على حدة للشركات الأم المصرية والكيانات المكوِّنة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>دراسات المقارنة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار الطريقة الأنسب، والبحث عن الشركات والمعاملات المماثلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>سياسات التسعير التحويلي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">سياسات تسعير للتوزيع والتصنيع والخدمات والإتاوات والتمويل داخل المجموعة، متسقة مع سلسلة القيمة للمجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الأتعاب الإدارية والخدمات داخل المجموعة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أدلة المنفعة وتوزيع التكاليف بما يدعم خصم هذه الرسوم في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدفاع في الفحص والرأي الضريبي المسبق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الرد على فحوص التسعير التحويلي، وطلب الرأي الضريبي المسبق حين يلزم اليقين قبل إتمام المعاملة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الفهم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مقابلة الإدارة وتحليل الوظائف والأصول والمخاطر لكل كيان.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المقارنة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار الطريقة واختبار التسعير مقابل البيانات المماثلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التوثيق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد ملفات تروي قصة متسقة على مستوى المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدفاع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مساندة الموقف خلال الفحص، وفي النزاع عند الحاجة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات المصرية التابعة لمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات، والمجموعات المصرية ذات الشركات الشقيقة في الخارج، والشركات ذات المعاملات الجوهرية مع المساهمين أو الشركات الشقيقة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من الملزم بإعداد توثيق التسعير التحويلي في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات التي تتجاوز معاملاتها مع الأطراف المرتبطة الحدود الواردة في اللائحة التنفيذية ملزمة بإعداد ملف رئيسي وملف محلي، والمجموعات التي تتجاوز حد التقرير على مستوى كل دولة ملزمة بتقديمه. وعلى جميع الممولين الإفصاح عن المعاملات مع الأطراف المرتبطة في إقرارهم السنوي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل الأتعاب الإدارية المدفوعة للشركة الأم واجبة الخصم؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم، بشرط أن تثبت الشركة أنها تلقّت الخدمات فعلاً، وأنها عادت بالنفع على النشاط في مصر، وأن المقابل يتفق مع السعر المحايد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>كم مرة ينبغي تحديث دراسة المقارنة؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ينبغي مراجعة المقارنات بانتظام وتحديثها كلما تغيّر نموذج العمل أو هيكل المجموعة أو ظروف السوق تغيّراً جوهرياً.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا عن ملف التسعير التحويلي الخاص بك.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:36:37.814');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwjnjnv001px0vci4v1hnu4', 'cmue38ep7000908vcqoqrbeix', 5, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"التسعير التحويلي","titleEn":"Transfer Pricing","bodyAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","bodyEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":3,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Documentation, benchmarking and policies that hold up at inspection.","shortDescriptionAr":"التوثيق والمقارنة المعيارية والسياسات التي تصمد أمام الفحص.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Transfer Pricing</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Intra-group pricing that stands up to inspection in Egypt and fits the group\'s global policy.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">A priority area for the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egyptian law requires transactions between related parties to follow the arm\'s length principle under Article 30 of the Income Tax Law and its Executive Regulations. Groups above the prescribed thresholds must prepare a master file, a local </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">file,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and, where applicable, a country-by-country report.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Late or missing documentation carries penalties under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, and inspection adjustments can be significant because they often span several years. The Egyptian Transfer Pricing Guidelines follow the OECD Guidelines, but local practice on comparables and management fees has features of its own.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Transfer pricing documentation: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation of the local file and support with the master file, in the required format and within the filing timeline.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Country-by-country reporting: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Notifications and country-by-country reports for Egyptian parent companies and constituent entities.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Benchmarking studies: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Selection of the most appropriate </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">method and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> searches for comparable companies and transactions.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Transfer pricing policies: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Pricing policies for distribution, manufacturing, services, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">royalties,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and intra-group financing, aligned with the group\'s value chain.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Management fees and intra-group services: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Benefit evidence and cost allocation that support the deductibility of charges in Egypt.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inspection defence and advance rulings: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Responses to transfer pricing </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">inspections and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> requests for advance tax rulings where certainty is needed before a transaction.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Understand</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Interview management and analyse the functions, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">assets,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and risks of each entity.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Benchmark</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Select the method and test the pricing against comparable data.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Document</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Prepare files that tell a consistent story across the group.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Defend</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Support the position through inspection and, if needed, dispute.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of multinational groups, Egyptian groups with foreign affiliates, and companies with significant transactions with shareholders or sister companies.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who must prepare transfer pricing documentation in Egypt?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Companies whose related-party transactions exceed the thresholds in the Executive Regulations must prepare a master file and a local file, and groups above the country-by-country threshold must file a report. All taxpayers must disclose related-party transactions in their annual return.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Are management fees paid to a parent company deductible?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes, provided the company can show that the services were actually received, that they benefited the Egyptian business, and that the charge is at arm\'s length.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>How often should a benchmarking study be updated?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Comparables should be reviewed regularly and refreshed whenever the business model, the group </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">structure,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or market conditions change materially.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us about your transfer pricing file.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التسعير التحويلي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تسعير داخل المجموعة يصمد أمام الفحص في مصر ويتسق مع السياسة العالمية للمجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أولوية لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُلزم القانون المصري بأن تتم المعاملات بين الأطراف المرتبطة وفق مبدأ السعر المحايد طبقاً للمادة 30 من قانون الضريبة على الدخل ولائحته التنفيذية. وعلى المجموعات التي تتجاوز الحدود المقررة إعداد ملف رئيسي وملف محلي، وتقرير على مستوى كل دولة على حدة متى انطبق ذلك.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يترتب على تأخر التوثيق أو غيابه غرامات وفق قانون الإجراءات الضريبية الموحد، وقد تكون تعديلات الفحص كبيرة لأنها كثيراً ما تمتد إلى عدة سنوات. وتتبع الإرشادات المصرية للتسعير التحويلي إرشادات منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، إلا أن للممارسة المحلية خصوصيتها في المقارنات والأتعاب الإدارية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>توثيق التسعير التحويلي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد الملف المحلي والمساندة في الملف الرئيسي، بالشكل المطلوب وضمن الجدول الزمني للتقديم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقارير على مستوى كل دولة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الإخطارات والتقارير على مستوى كل دولة على حدة للشركات الأم المصرية والكيانات المكوِّنة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>دراسات المقارنة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار الطريقة الأنسب، والبحث عن الشركات والمعاملات المماثلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>سياسات التسعير التحويلي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">سياسات تسعير للتوزيع والتصنيع والخدمات والإتاوات والتمويل داخل المجموعة، متسقة مع سلسلة القيمة للمجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الأتعاب الإدارية والخدمات داخل المجموعة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أدلة المنفعة وتوزيع التكاليف بما يدعم خصم هذه الرسوم في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدفاع في الفحص والرأي الضريبي المسبق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الرد على فحوص التسعير التحويلي، وطلب الرأي الضريبي المسبق حين يلزم اليقين قبل إتمام المعاملة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الفهم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مقابلة الإدارة وتحليل الوظائف والأصول والمخاطر لكل كيان.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المقارنة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اختيار الطريقة واختبار التسعير مقابل البيانات المماثلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التوثيق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد ملفات تروي قصة متسقة على مستوى المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الدفاع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مساندة الموقف خلال الفحص، وفي النزاع عند الحاجة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات المصرية التابعة لمجموعات متعددة الجنسيات، والمجموعات المصرية ذات الشركات الشقيقة في الخارج، والشركات ذات المعاملات الجوهرية مع المساهمين أو الشركات الشقيقة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من الملزم بإعداد توثيق التسعير التحويلي في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات التي تتجاوز معاملاتها مع الأطراف المرتبطة الحدود الواردة في اللائحة التنفيذية ملزمة بإعداد ملف رئيسي وملف محلي، والمجموعات التي تتجاوز حد التقرير على مستوى كل دولة ملزمة بتقديمه. وعلى جميع الممولين الإفصاح عن المعاملات مع الأطراف المرتبطة في إقرارهم السنوي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل الأتعاب الإدارية المدفوعة للشركة الأم واجبة الخصم؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم، بشرط أن تثبت الشركة أنها تلقّت الخدمات فعلاً، وأنها عادت بالنفع على النشاط في مصر، وأن المقابل يتفق مع السعر المحايد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>كم مرة ينبغي تحديث دراسة المقارنة؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ينبغي مراجعة المقارنات بانتظام وتحديثها كلما تغيّر نموذج العمل أو هيكل المجموعة أو ظروف السوق تغيّراً جوهرياً.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا عن ملف التسعير التحويلي الخاص بك.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:36:49.099');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwjrmx8001qx0vcrg5qh825', 'cmue38eq6000a08vczid6w27k', 5, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"حل المنازعات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Dispute Resolution","bodyAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","bodyEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":4,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","shortDescriptionAr":"الفحص، الاعتراض، اللجان والتسوية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Tax Dispute Resolution</strong></span></p><p></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">A disputed assessment is a negotiation with strict rules. We prepare for it from the first inspection request.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Most disputes are decided before the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">committee.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, a taxpayer who disagrees with an assessment must object within strict statutory deadlines. The dispute then moves through internal committees and </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">appeal committees</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and can reach the courts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The outcome largely depends on the strength of the file at inspection: reconciliations, contracts, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">e-invoices,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and board records. A missed deadline can make an assessment final regardless of its merits.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inspection readiness:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A review of your records and positions before the inspector arrives, so the file is complete and consistent.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Managing the inspection:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Attendance at inspection meetings, responses to information requests, and challenge of adjustments that the evidence does not support.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Objections and internal committees:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Technical memoranda and representation at the internal committee stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Appeal Committees:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation of the case, supporting </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">evidence,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and representation before the Appeal Committees.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Settlement:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assessment of settlement options, including applications under Law No. 79 of 2016, currently extended to 31 December 2026.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Litigation support:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Technical tax support to legal counsel where a dispute proceeds to court.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Assess</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review the assessment, the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the strength of each point.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Prepare</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Build the evidence file and the technical arguments.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Represent</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Present the case at each stage of the process.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Resolve</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Close the dispute through a decision or a negotiated settlement, whichever serves you better.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Companies facing a tax inspection or an assessment they disagree with, and investors who have acquired a company with open disputes.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What happens if the objection deadline is missed?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The assessment can become final and enforceable, which sharply limits the options that remain. Contact an adviser as soon as you receive a notice.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Is there a settlement scheme available now?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. Law No. 79 of 2016 on the settlement of tax disputes has been extended to 31 December 2026. A settlement request must be submitted by that date; the case itself does not need to be closed by then.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Is it better to settle or to appeal?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">It depends on the amount, the strength of the evidence and the cost of time. We give you a clear view of both routes before you decide.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 4pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Received a tax assessment? Talk to us before the deadline runs.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تسوية</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المنازعات</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الربط المتنازع عليه تفاوضٌ بقواعد صارمة. ونستعد له منذ أول طلب للفحص.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">معظم المنازعات تحسم قبل اللجنة</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بموجب قانون الإجراءات الضريبية الموحد، على الممول الذي يعترض على الربط أن يطعن خلال مواعيد قانونية صارمة. ثم ينتقل النزاع إلى اللجان الداخلية ولجان الطعن، وقد يصل إلى القضاء.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تتوقف النتيجة إلى حد كبير على قوة الملف عند الفحص: المطابقات والعقود والفواتير الإلكترونية ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة. وقد يؤدي فوات ميعاد واحد إلى صيرورة الربط نهائياً بصرف النظر عن موضوعه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاستعداد للفحص: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة سجلاتك ومواقفك قبل وصول مأمور الفحص، ليكون الملف مكتملاً ومتسقاً.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>إدارة الفحص: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">حضور جلسات الفحص، والرد على طلبات المعلومات، والاعتراض على التعديلات التي لا تدعمها المستندات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطعون واللجان الداخلية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مذكرات فنية وتمثيل أمام اللجان الداخلية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>لجان الطعن: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد القضية والمستندات المؤيدة والتمثيل أمام لجان الطعن.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التسوية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم خيارات التسوية، بما في ذلك الطلبات وفق القانون رقم 79 لسنة 2016 الممتد حالياً حتى 31 ديسمبر 2026.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مساندة التقاضي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">دعم ضريبي فني للمستشار القانوني إذا وصل النزاع إلى المحكمة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقييم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة الربط والمواعيد ومدى قوة كل بند.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجهيز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد ملف المستندات والحجج الفنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التمثيل</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض القضية في كل مرحلة من مراحل النزاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الحسم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إنهاء النزاع بقرار أو بتسوية تفاوضية، أيهما يخدم مصلحتك أكثر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات التي تواجه فحصاً ضريبياً أو ربطاً تعترض عليه، والمستثمرون الذين استحوذوا على شركة لديها منازعات قائمة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ماذا يحدث إذا فات ميعاد الطعن؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">قد يصبح الربط نهائياً وواجب النفاذ، مما يضيّق الخيارات المتبقية بشدة. تواصل مع مستشار فور استلامك أي إخطار.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يوجد نظام للتسوية متاح حالياً؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. مُدّ العمل بالقانون رقم 79 لسنة 2016 بشأن إنهاء المنازعات الضريبية حتى 31 ديسمبر 2026. ويجب تقديم طلب التسوية بحلول هذا التاريخ، ولا يُشترط إنهاء النزاع ذاته بحلوله.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>أيهما أفضل: التسوية أم الطعن؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يتوقف ذلك على المبلغ وقوة المستندات وتكلفة الوقت. ونقدّم لك رؤية واضحة للمسارين قبل أن تقرر.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تسلمت ربطاً ضريبياً؟ تحدث معنا قبل فوات الميعاد.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["bodyAr","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:39:59.948');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwjsfhi001rx0vc159grt85', 'cmue38eq6000a08vczid6w27k', 6, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"حل المنازعات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Dispute Resolution","bodyAr":"الفحص، والطعن، واللجان، والتسوية.","bodyEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":4,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","shortDescriptionAr":"الفحص، والطعن، واللجان، والتسوية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Tax Dispute Resolution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">A disputed assessment is a negotiation with strict rules. We prepare for it from the first inspection request.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Most disputes are decided before the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">committee.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, a taxpayer who disagrees with an assessment must object within strict statutory deadlines. The dispute then moves through internal committees and </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">appeal committees</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and can reach the courts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The outcome largely depends on the strength of the file at inspection: reconciliations, contracts, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">e-invoices,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and board records. A missed deadline can make an assessment final regardless of its merits.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inspection readiness:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A review of your records and positions before the inspector arrives, so the file is complete and consistent.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Managing the inspection:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Attendance at inspection meetings, responses to information requests, and challenge of adjustments that the evidence does not support.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Objections and internal committees:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Technical memoranda and representation at the internal committee stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Appeal Committees:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation of the case, supporting </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">evidence,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and representation before the Appeal Committees.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Settlement:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assessment of settlement options, including applications under Law No. 79 of 2016, currently extended to 31 December 2026.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Litigation support:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Technical tax support to legal counsel where a dispute proceeds to court.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Assess</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review the assessment, the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the strength of each point.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Prepare</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Build the evidence file and the technical arguments.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Represent</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Present the case at each stage of the process.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Resolve</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Close the dispute through a decision or a negotiated settlement, whichever serves you better.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Companies facing a tax inspection or an assessment they disagree with, and investors who have acquired a company with open disputes.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What happens if the objection deadline is missed?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The assessment can become final and enforceable, which sharply limits the options that remain. Contact an adviser as soon as you receive a notice.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Is there a settlement scheme available now?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. Law No. 79 of 2016 on the settlement of tax disputes has been extended to 31 December 2026. A settlement request must be submitted by that date; the case itself does not need to be closed by then.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Is it better to settle or to appeal?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">It depends on the amount, the strength of the evidence and the cost of time. We give you a clear view of both routes before you decide.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Received a tax assessment? Talk to us before the deadline runs.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تسوية</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المنازعات</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الربط المتنازع عليه تفاوضٌ بقواعد صارمة. ونستعد له منذ أول طلب للفحص.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">معظم المنازعات تحسم قبل اللجنة</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بموجب قانون الإجراءات الضريبية الموحد، على الممول الذي يعترض على الربط أن يطعن خلال مواعيد قانونية صارمة. ثم ينتقل النزاع إلى اللجان الداخلية ولجان الطعن، وقد يصل إلى القضاء.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تتوقف النتيجة إلى حد كبير على قوة الملف عند الفحص: المطابقات والعقود والفواتير الإلكترونية ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة. وقد يؤدي فوات ميعاد واحد إلى صيرورة الربط نهائياً بصرف النظر عن موضوعه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاستعداد للفحص: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة سجلاتك ومواقفك قبل وصول مأمور الفحص، ليكون الملف مكتملاً ومتسقاً.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>إدارة الفحص: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">حضور جلسات الفحص، والرد على طلبات المعلومات، والاعتراض على التعديلات التي لا تدعمها المستندات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطعون واللجان الداخلية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مذكرات فنية وتمثيل أمام اللجان الداخلية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>لجان الطعن: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد القضية والمستندات المؤيدة والتمثيل أمام لجان الطعن.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التسوية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم خيارات التسوية، بما في ذلك الطلبات وفق القانون رقم 79 لسنة 2016 الممتد حالياً حتى 31 ديسمبر 2026.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مساندة التقاضي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">دعم ضريبي فني للمستشار القانوني إذا وصل النزاع إلى المحكمة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقييم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة الربط والمواعيد ومدى قوة كل بند.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجهيز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد ملف المستندات والحجج الفنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التمثيل</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض القضية في كل مرحلة من مراحل النزاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الحسم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إنهاء النزاع بقرار أو بتسوية تفاوضية، أيهما يخدم مصلحتك أكثر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات التي تواجه فحصاً ضريبياً أو ربطاً تعترض عليه، والمستثمرون الذين استحوذوا على شركة لديها منازعات قائمة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ماذا يحدث إذا فات ميعاد الطعن؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">قد يصبح الربط نهائياً وواجب النفاذ، مما يضيّق الخيارات المتبقية بشدة. تواصل مع مستشار فور استلامك أي إخطار.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يوجد نظام للتسوية متاح حالياً؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. مُدّ العمل بالقانون رقم 79 لسنة 2016 بشأن إنهاء المنازعات الضريبية حتى 31 ديسمبر 2026. ويجب تقديم طلب التسوية بحلول هذا التاريخ، ولا يُشترط إنهاء النزاع ذاته بحلوله.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>أيهما أفضل: التسوية أم الطعن؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يتوقف ذلك على المبلغ وقوة المستندات وتكلفة الوقت. ونقدّم لك رؤية واضحة للمسارين قبل أن تقرر.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تسلمت ربطاً ضريبياً؟ تحدث معنا قبل فوات الميعاد.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:40:36.966');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwjy6ua001sx0vcqj3r16tx', 'cmue38eq6000a08vczid6w27k', 7, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"حل المنازعات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Dispute Resolution","bodyAr":"الفحص، والطعن، واللجان، والتسوية.","bodyEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":4,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Inspection, objection, committees and settlement.","shortDescriptionAr":"الفحص، والطعن، واللجان، والتسوية.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Tax Dispute Resolution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">A disputed assessment is a negotiation with strict rules. We prepare for it from the first inspection request.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Most disputes are decided before the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">committee.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law, a taxpayer who disagrees with an assessment must object within strict statutory deadlines. The dispute then moves through internal committees and </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">appeal committees</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and can reach the courts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The outcome largely depends on the strength of the file at inspection: reconciliations, contracts, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">e-invoices,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and board records. A missed deadline can make an assessment final regardless of its merits.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Inspection readiness:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A review of your records and positions before the inspector arrives, so the file is complete and consistent.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Managing the inspection:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Attendance at inspection meetings, responses to information requests, and challenge of adjustments that the evidence does not support.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Objections and internal committees:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Technical memoranda and representation at the internal committee stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Appeal Committees:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation of the case, supporting </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">evidence,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and representation before the Appeal Committees.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Settlement:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assessment of settlement options, including applications under Law No. 79 of 2016, currently extended to 31 December 2026.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Litigation support:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Technical tax support to legal counsel where a dispute proceeds to court.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Assess</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review the assessment, the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the strength of each point.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Prepare</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Build the evidence file and the technical arguments.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Represent</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Present the case at each stage of the process.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Resolve</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Close the dispute through a decision or a negotiated settlement, whichever serves you better.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Companies facing a tax inspection or an assessment they disagree with, and investors who have acquired a company with open disputes.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>What happens if the objection deadline is missed?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The assessment can become final and enforceable, which sharply limits the options that remain. Contact an adviser as soon as you receive a notice.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Is there a settlement scheme available now?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. Law No. 79 of 2016 on the settlement of tax disputes has been extended to 31 December 2026. A settlement request must be submitted by that date; the case itself does not need to be closed by then.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Is it better to settle or to appeal?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">It depends on the amount, the strength of the evidence and the cost of time. We give you a clear view of both routes before you decide.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Received a tax assessment? Talk to us before the deadline runs.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تسوية</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المنازعات</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الربط المتنازع عليه تفاوض بقواعد صارمة. ونستعد له منذ أول طلب للفحص.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">معظم المنازعات تحسم قبل اللجنة</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بموجب قانون الإجراءات الضريبية الموحد، على الممول الذي يعترض على الربط أن يطعن خلال مواعيد قانونية صارمة. ثم ينتقل النزاع إلى اللجان الداخلية ولجان الطعن، وقد يصل إلى القضاء.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تتوقف النتيجة إلى حد كبير على قوة الملف عند الفحص: المطابقات والعقود والفواتير الإلكترونية ومحاضر مجلس الإدارة. وقد يؤدي فوات ميعاد واحد إلى صيرورة الربط نهائياً بصرف النظر عن موضوعه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاستعداد للفحص: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة سجلاتك ومواقفك قبل وصول مأمور الفحص، ليكون الملف مكتملاً ومتسقاً.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>إدارة الفحص: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">حضور جلسات الفحص، والرد على طلبات المعلومات، والاعتراض على التعديلات التي لا تدعمها المستندات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطعون واللجان الداخلية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مذكرات فنية وتمثيل أمام اللجان الداخلية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>لجان الطعن: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد القضية والمستندات المؤيدة والتمثيل أمام لجان الطعن.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التسوية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم خيارات التسوية، بما في ذلك الطلبات وفق القانون رقم 79 لسنة 2016 الممتد حالياً حتى 31 ديسمبر 2026.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مساندة التقاضي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">دعم ضريبي فني للمستشار القانوني إذا وصل النزاع إلى المحكمة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقييم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة الربط والمواعيد ومدى قوة كل بند.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجهيز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد ملف المستندات والحجج الفنية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التمثيل</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض القضية في كل مرحلة من مراحل النزاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤&nbsp; ·&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الحسم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إنهاء النزاع بقرار أو بتسوية تفاوضية، أيهما يخدم مصلحتك أكثر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات التي تواجه فحصاً ضريبياً أو ربطاً تعترض عليه، والمستثمرون الذين استحوذوا على شركة لديها منازعات قائمة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ماذا يحدث إذا فات ميعاد الطعن؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">قد يصبح الربط نهائياً وواجب النفاذ، مما يضيّق الخيارات المتبقية بشدة. تواصل مع مستشار فور استلامك أي إخطار.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يوجد نظام للتسوية متاح حالياً؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. مُدّ العمل بالقانون رقم ٧٩ لسنة ٢٠١٦ بشأن إنهاء المنازعات الضريبية حتى ٣١ ديسمبر ٢٠٢٦. ويجب تقديم طلب التسوية بحلول هذا التاريخ، ولا يُشترط إنهاء النزاع ذاته بحلوله.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>أيهما أفضل: التسوية أم الطعن؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يتوقف ذلك على المبلغ وقوة المستندات وتكلفة الوقت. ونقدّم لك رؤية واضحة للمسارين قبل أن تقرر.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تسلمت ربطاً ضريبياً؟ تحدث معنا قبل فوات الميعاد.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["titleAr","bodyAr","bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:45:05.698');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwka5kr001tx0vcl6mzejqo', 'cmue38erv000c08vcg5tj0w6i', 1, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"المحاسبة الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Accounting","bodyAr":"الضريبة الجارية والمؤجلة التي يمكن لمدققك والشركة الأم الاعتماد عليها.","bodyEn":"<p class=\\"service-lead\\">Tax numbers in your financial statements that your auditor, your board and your parent company can rely on.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Tax is one of the most judgement-heavy lines in the accounts</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\">Income tax balances under Egyptian Accounting Standard No. 24 and IAS 12 require judgement on deferred tax, the recoverability of tax losses and uncertain positions. Errors tend to surface as late audit adjustments or, worse, restatements.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">How we help</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Current tax provisions:</strong> Quarterly and year-end tax computations, reconciled to the return that will be filed.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Deferred tax:</strong> Identification of temporary differences and assessment of deferred tax assets, including those arising from tax losses.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Uncertain tax positions:</strong> Assessment, measurement and disclosure of uncertain tax treatments in line with IFRIC 23 for IFRS reporting.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Group reporting packs:</strong> Tax sections of IFRS reporting packs for foreign parents, delivered on the group timetable.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Our approach</h2>\\n<ol class=\\"service-steps\\"><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 1</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Gather</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Collect trial balances, fixed asset registers and prior computations.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 2</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Compute</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Calculate current and deferred tax and test the judgements.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 3</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Reconcile</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Tie the provision to the return and the effective tax rate.</span></li><li class=\\"service-step\\"><span class=\\"service-step-num\\">Step 4</span><span class=\\"service-step-title\\">Report</span><span class=\\"service-step-body\\">Deliver disclosures and working papers ready for audit.</span></li></ol>\\n<div class=\\"service-highlight\\"><span class=\\"service-highlight-title\\">Who we advise</span><span class=\\"service-highlight-body\\">Subsidiaries of foreign groups, companies preparing for audit or investment, and finance teams without an in-house tax specialist.</span></div>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments.</p>\\n<p class=\\"service-p\\"><strong class=\\"service-strong\\">Digital by design:</strong> Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings.</p>\\n<h2 class=\\"service-h2\\">Questions investors ask</h2>\\n<div class=\\"service-faq-list\\"><details class=\\"service-faq\\" open><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Can you prepare our tax provision if you are also our statutory auditor?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">No. To protect auditor independence, where we are the statutory auditor the provision is prepared by the company or by another adviser.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">When should deferred tax be recognised on tax losses?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">When it is probable that future taxable profit will be available to use the losses before they expire. This requires a supportable forecast.</p></details><details class=\\"service-faq\\"><summary class=\\"service-faq-q\\">Do you work with the group\'s own tax team?</summary><p class=\\"service-faq-a\\">Yes. We work to the group\'s instructions, templates and timetable, and flag Egyptian-specific issues early.</p></details></div>\\n<p class=\\"service-closing\\">Talk to us before your year-end close.</p>","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":6,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Current and deferred tax your auditor and parent company can rely on.","shortDescriptionAr":"الضريبة الجارية والمؤجلة التي يمكن لمدققك والشركة الأم الاعتماد عليها."}}', '["bodyAr","bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:54:23.931');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwkc6z8001ux0vc5w7mzlih', 'cmue38erv000c08vcg5tj0w6i', 2, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"المحاسبة الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Accounting","bodyAr":"ضريبة جارية ومؤجلة يعتمد عليها مراقب حساباتك والشركة الأم.","bodyEn":"Current and deferred tax your auditor and parent company can rely on.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":6,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Current and deferred tax your auditor and parent company can rely on.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة جارية ومؤجلة يعتمد عليها مراقب حساباتك والشركة الأم.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Tax Accounting</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Tax numbers in your financial statements that your auditor, your </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">board,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"> and your parent company can rely on.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax is one of the most judgement-heavy lines in the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">accounts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Income tax balances under Egyptian Accounting Standard No. 24 and IAS 12 require judgement on deferred tax, the recoverability of tax </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">losses,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and uncertain positions. Errors tend to surface as late audit adjustments or, worse, restatements.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">For subsidiaries of foreign groups, the Egyptian tax charge must also be reported accurately and fast in the group reporting pack.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Current tax provisions:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Quarterly and year-end tax computations, reconciled to the return that will be filed.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deferred tax:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Identification of temporary differences and assessment of deferred tax assets, including those arising from tax losses.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Uncertain tax positions:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assessment, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">measurement,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and disclosure of uncertain tax treatments in line with IFRIC 23 for IFRS reporting.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Effective tax rate analysis:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Reconciliation of the statutory and effective tax rates for disclosures and board reporting.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Group reporting packs:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax sections of IFRS reporting packs for foreign parents, delivered on the group timetable.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Audit support:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax working papers prepared for review by your external auditor.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Gather</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Collect trial balances, fixed asset </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">registers,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and prior computations.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Compute</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Calculate current and deferred tax and test the judgements.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reconcile</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tie the provision to the return and the effective tax rate.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Report</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Deliver disclosures and working papers ready for audit.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Subsidiaries of foreign groups, companies preparing for audit or investment, and finance teams without an in-house tax specialist.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Can you prepare our tax provision if you are also our statutory auditor?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">No. To protect auditor independence, where we are the statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditor,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> the provision is prepared by the company or by another adviser.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>When should deferred tax be recognised on tax losses?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">When it is probable that future taxable profit will be available to use the losses before they expire. This requires a supportable forecast.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Do you work with the group\'s own tax team?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Yes. We work to the group\'s instructions, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">templates,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and timetable, and flag Egyptian-specific issues early.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us before your year-end close.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المحاسبة</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أرقام ضريبية في قوائمك المالية يعتمد عليها مراقب حساباتك ومجلس إدارتك والشركة الأم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الضريبة من أكثر بنود القوائم المالية اعتماداً على التقدير</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تتطلب أرصدة ضريبة الدخل وفق معيار المحاسبة المصري رقم 24 ومعيار المحاسبة الدولي 12 تقديراً مهنياً للضريبة المؤجلة وإمكانية استرداد الخسائر الضريبية والمواقف غير المؤكدة. وعادةً ما تظهر الأخطاء في صورة تسويات مراجعة متأخرة، أو الأسوأ، إعادة إصدار القوائم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">وبالنسبة للشركات التابعة لمجموعات أجنبية، يجب كذلك عرض العبء الضريبي المصري بدقة وسرعة في حزمة التقارير الخاصة بالمجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مخصصات الضريبة الجارية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">حسابات الضريبة الربع سنوية وفي نهاية السنة، مطابقة مع الإقرار الذي سيُقدَّم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضريبة المؤجلة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحديد الفروق المؤقتة وتقييم الأصول الضريبية المؤجلة، بما فيها الناشئة عن الخسائر الضريبية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المواقف الضريبية غير المؤكدة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تقييم المعالجات الضريبية غير المؤكدة وقياسها والإفصاح عنها وفق التفسير IFRIC 23 لأغراض التقارير وفق المعايير الدولية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تحليل السعر الفعلي للضريبة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مطابقة السعر القانوني والسعر الفعلي للضريبة لأغراض الإفصاح وتقارير مجلس الإدارة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>حزم تقارير المجموعة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأقسام الضريبية في حزم التقارير وفق المعايير الدولية للشركات الأم الأجنبية، وفق الجدول الزمني للمجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>مساندة المراجعة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أوراق عمل ضريبية مُعدّة لمراجعة مراقب الحسابات الخارجي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجميع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تجميع موازين المراجعة وسجلات الأصول الثابتة والحسابات السابقة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الاحتساب</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">احتساب الضريبة الجارية والمؤجلة واختبار التقديرات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المطابقة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ربط المخصص بالإقرار وبالسعر الفعلي للضريبة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقرير</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تسليم الإفصاحات وأوراق العمل جاهزة للمراجعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات التابعة لمجموعات أجنبية، والشركات التي تستعد للمراجعة أو للاستثمار، والإدارات المالية التي تفتقر إلى متخصص ضريبي داخلي.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل يمكنكم إعداد المخصص الضريبي إذا كنتم مراقب حساباتنا أيضاً؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لا. حفاظاً على استقلال مراقب الحسابات، إذا كنا مراقب الحسابات القانوني يتولى الشركة أو مستشار آخر إعداد المخصص.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>متى يعترف بالضريبة المؤجلة على الخسائر الضريبية؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">حين يكون من المرجح توافر أرباح مستقبلية خاضعة للضريبة تُستخدم فيها الخسائر قبل انقضاء مدتها. ويتطلب ذلك توقعات قابلة للإثبات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تعملون مع الفريق الضريبي للمجموعة؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعم. نعمل وفق تعليمات المجموعة ونماذجها وجدولها الزمني، وننبّه مبكراً إلى المسائل الخاصة بمصر.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا قبل إقفال نهاية السنة.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 10:55:59.060');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwkjyxm001vx0vcndoll2sa', 'cmue38fmh001908vcikwfz2qn', 1, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"إعداد الفوترة الإلكترونية والإيصالات الإلكترونية","titleEn":"E-Invoicing & E-Receipt Set-Up","bodyAr":"دمج أنظمة المبيعات الإلكترونية مع منصتي الفوترة الإلكترونية والإيصالات الإلكترونية لهيئة الضرائب.","bodyEn":"Integration of online sales systems with the ETA e-invoice and e-receipt platforms.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"ecommerce-digital-business","displayOrder":3,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Integration of online sales systems with the ETA e-invoice and e-receipt platforms.","shortDescriptionAr":"دمج أنظمة المبيعات الإلكترونية مع منصتي الفوترة الإلكترونية والإيصالات الإلكترونية لهيئة الضرائب."}}', '["titleAr","titleEn","bodyAr","bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 11:02:01.882');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwl3n7w0027x0vcufrrh29x', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 17, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate tax, VAT, international tax, transfer pricing, and tax disputes in Egypt. Tax certainty for local companies and foreign investors.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h2 style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</span></h2><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">investors. </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</span></p><h2 style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Sectors we serve</span></h2><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Concession-based tax </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">regimes and</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">tax,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the disposal of property</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(84, 130, 53);\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we work with you</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">deadlines,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and what you need to achieve</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Inter, serif;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["bodyEn","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 11:17:19.820');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwl9q0a002ax0vc9la87gyk', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 18, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, and e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, and e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 16px;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">Sectors we serve</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">How we work with you</h2><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Reply</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Scope</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines and what you need to achieve.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Propose</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed.</p><p></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 11:22:03.370');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwljuht002jx0vc0f9mokdb', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 19, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, and e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, and e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 16px;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">Sectors we serve</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</p><h3 style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 24px 0px 6px;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></h3><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">How we work with you</h2><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Reply</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Scope</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines and what you need to achieve.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Propose</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 11:29:55.745');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwloopu002ox0vc0ckx8wj2', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 20, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, and e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, and e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 16px;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">Sectors we serve</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">How we work with you</h2><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Reply</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Scope</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines and what you need to achieve.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Propose</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</p><p style=\\"font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(11, 23, 38); margin: 0px 0px 8px;\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></p><p style=\\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(74, 85, 102); margin: 0px;\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed.</p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 11:33:41.538');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwmv4ci002rx0vc7gpvb3xb', 'cmue38eg6000008vc2yuy5hfm', 21, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الاستشارات الضريبية","titleEn":"Tax Advisory","bodyAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, and e-invoicing.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"category","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":"FileText","shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, transfer pricing, international tax, tax disputes, and e-invoicing.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة الشركات، والقيمة المضافة، والضرائب الدولية، والتسعير التحويلي، والمنازعات الضريبية في مصر. يقين ضريبي للشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب.","fullDescriptionEn":"<h2 style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 0px 0px 16px;\\">Tax certainty for investing and operating in Egypt</h2><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Uncertainty is priced into every decision by investors. In Egypt, tax is often the largest source of it: rules change frequently, the Egyptian Tax Authority now reviews filings through connected digital systems, and open tax years can stay open for a long time.</p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">We give local companies and foreign investors a clear view of their tax position from set-up to exit. We keep compliance accurate, structure transactions before they happen, and represent clients when positions are challenged, so tax becomes a managed cost rather than a surprise.</p><h2 style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">Sectors we serve</h2><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\">Tax issues differ by industry. These are the questions we see most often in each sector.</p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 7%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; industry</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">VAT deferral on machinery and production lines, investment incentives, free zone and Suez Canal Economic Zone regimes, and transfer pricing on group purchases.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Energy, oil &amp; gas</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">Concession-based tax regimes, and withholding tax and permanent establishment exposure for foreign service contractors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 7%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Real estate &amp; construction</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">Tax treatment of long-term contracts, VAT on contracting services, real estate tax and the disposal of property.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Technology &amp; digital</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">VAT on digital services, e-invoicing integration, and the tax treatment of software and royalty payments abroad.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 7%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Trading, logistics &amp; distribution</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">VAT on imports and transit trade, transfer pricing for distributors, and e-receipt compliance for retail.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Healthcare &amp; pharmaceuticals</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">Recent VAT changes on medical devices, VAT on imported equipment, and pricing between group suppliers and local distributors.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 7%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Financial services</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">VAT treatment of non-bank financial services, capital market tax measures, and withholding on cross-border financing.</span></p><h2 style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</h2><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong> Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory auditors and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>International standards:</strong> We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a lender or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority.</p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong> We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer pricing and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong> Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, continuity and accountability at every stage.</p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong> Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</p><h2 style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;, Georgia, serif; direction: ltr; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: rgb(140, 106, 42); margin: 40px 0px 16px;\\">How we work with you</h2><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 7%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 13px;\\"><strong>STEP 1</strong></span><br><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Reply</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">We respond to every request within one business day.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 13px;\\"><strong>STEP 2</strong></span><br><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Scope</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">A meeting to understand your position, your deadlines and what you need to achieve.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 7%; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 13px;\\"><strong>STEP 3</strong></span><br><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Propose</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">A written proposal setting out the scope, the team, the fees and the timeline before any work starts.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: left; font-family: Inter, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; direction: ltr; display: inline-block; width: 45%; vertical-align: top; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 28px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(201, 169, 110); padding-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 13px;\\"><strong>STEP 4</strong></span><br><span style=\\"font-size: 18px;\\"><strong>Deliver</strong></span><br><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102);\\">A named partner accountable for the result, with regular updates until the matter is closed.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقين ضريبي للاستثمار والعمل في مصر</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يُدخل المستثمرون عنصر عدم اليقين في حساب كل قرار. وفي مصر، كثيراً ما تكون الضرائب أكبر مصادره: فالقواعد تتغير باستمرار، ومصلحة الضرائب المصرية باتت تراجع الإقرارات عبر منظومات رقمية مترابطة، والسنوات الضريبية المفتوحة قد تظل مفتوحة لفترات طويلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نمنح الشركات المحلية والمستثمرين الأجانب رؤية واضحة لموقفهم الضريبي من التأسيس وحتى التخارج. نحافظ على دقة الالتزام، ونهيكل المعاملات قبل تنفيذها، وننوب عن عملائنا حين يُعترض على مواقفهم، لتصبح الضريبة تكلفة مُدارة لا مفاجأة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">القطاعات التي نخدمها</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تختلف القضايا الضريبية من قطاع إلى آخر. وفيما يلي أكثر المسائل التي نتعامل معها في كل قطاع.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الصناعة والتصنيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تأجيل ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الآلات وخطوط الإنتاج، والحوافز الاستثمارية، وأنظمة المناطق الحرة والمنطقة الاقتصادية لقناة السويس، والتسعير التحويلي على مشتريات المجموعة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الطاقة والبترول والغاز</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الأنظمة الضريبية القائمة على اتفاقيات الالتزام، وضريبة الخصم ومخاطر المنشأة الدائمة لمقاولي الخدمات الأجانب.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>العقارات والمقاولات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للعقود طويلة الأجل، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على خدمات المقاولات، والضريبة العقارية، والتصرف في العقارات.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التكنولوجيا والاقتصاد الرقمي</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الخدمات الرقمية، وربط منظومة الفاتورة الإلكترونية، والمعاملة الضريبية لمدفوعات البرمجيات والإتاوات إلى الخارج.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التجارة والخدمات اللوجستية والتوزيع</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">ضريبة القيمة المضافة على الواردات وتجارة الترانزيت، والتسعير التحويلي للموزعين، والالتزام بمنظومة الإيصال الإلكتروني في تجارة التجزئة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الرعاية الصحية والأدوية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التعديلات الأخيرة لضريبة القيمة المضافة على الأجهزة الطبية، وضريبة القيمة المضافة على المعدات المستوردة، والتسعير بين موردي المجموعة والموزعين المحليين.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخدمات المالية</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">المعاملة الضريبية للقيمة المضافة على الخدمات المالية غير المصرفية، والإجراءات الضريبية الخاصة بسوق المال، وضريبة الخصم على التمويل العابر للحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نعمل معك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 1 · الرد</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نرد على كل طلب خلال يوم عمل واحد.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 2 · تحديد</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> النطاق</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">اجتماع لفهم موقفك ومواعيدك النهائية وما تحتاج إلى تحقيقه.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 3 · العرض</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">عرض مكتوب يحدد النطاق والفريق والأتعاب والجدول الزمني قبل بدء أي عمل.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة 4 · التنفيذ</strong></span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">شريك مسمّى مسؤول عن النتيجة، مع تحديثات منتظمة حتى إغلاق الملف</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Sans Arabic&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["bodyAr","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 12:06:41.347');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `ContentRevision` (`id`, `contentId`, `revisionNumber`, `previousState`, `changedFields`, `changedById`, `createdAt`) VALUES ('cmuwn36qv002wx0vcf8t8xbw3', 'cmue38en8000708vcxwy31ai2', 14, '{"type":"service","titleAr":"الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة","titleEn":"Direct & Indirect Taxation","bodyAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مقدمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","bodyEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","status":"published","metadata":{"serviceType":"sub-service","categorySlug":"tax-advisory","displayOrder":1,"icon":null,"shortDescriptionEn":"Corporate income tax, VAT, withholding and stamp tax, filed accurately and on time.","shortDescriptionAr":"ضريبة دخل الشركات، ضريبة القيمة المضافة، ضريبة الاستقطاع وضريبة الدمغة، مقدمة بدقة وفي الوقت المحدد.","fullDescriptionEn":"<p><span style=\\"color: black; font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\"><strong>Direct &amp; Indirect Taxation</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\">Accurate returns, filed on time, with every position documented before the Egyptian Tax Authority asks for it.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Compliance is now digital, and so is </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">scrutiny.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Under the Unified Tax Procedures Law No. 206 of 2020, returns, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">invoices,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and payments flow through the Egyptian Tax Authority\'s electronic systems. The Authority can now match your filings against the data submitted by your customers and suppliers</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Small inconsistencies between the VAT return, the </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">e-invoices,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and the corporate tax return have become a common trigger for inspection. For foreign-owned companies the stakes are higher: tax cost feeds directly into the results reported to the parent and the cash available for dividends</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">How we help</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Corporate income tax:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Preparation and filing of the annual return under Income Tax Law No. 91 of 2005, computation of taxable profit, review of deductible expenses and provisions, and planning for the use of carried-forward losses</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Value added tax:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Registration, monthly returns under VAT Law No. 67 of 2016, input tax recovery, treatment of exempt, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">zero-rated,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and export supplies, and table tax on scheduled goods and services</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Withholding tax:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Quarterly filings under the advance payment system and withholding on payments to non-residents, with reconciliations that support the credits you claim</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Stamp tax:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Assessment of stamp tax on contracts, advertising, banking </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">facilities,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and other taxable instruments under Stamp Tax Law No. 111 of 1980.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Tax health check:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">A review of the open tax years that identifies exposures and corrects them before the Authority\'s inspection does</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Tax calendar:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">One schedule of every filing and payment deadline, owned by us and shared with your finance team, so nothing depends on memory.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Our approach</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 1</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Diagnose</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Review returns, accounting </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">records,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and e-invoice data for the open years</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 2</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Correct</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Close gaps and document the positions taken.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 3</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>File</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Prepare and submit returns within the statutory deadlines</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>Step 4</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 125%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Monitor</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Track changes in law and ETA practice, and explain what each one means for you</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Who we advise</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Egyptian subsidiaries of foreign groups, family-owned and investor-backed companies, and foreign investors in their first years of operation in Egypt</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Why choose Sherif Yousry?</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Licensed accountants and advisers:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our team brings together licensed accountants, registered statutory </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">auditors,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and certified tax experts, with more than two decades of professional experience across the Egyptian market.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International standards: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We work to International Financial Reporting Standards and International Standards on Auditing alongside Egyptian standards, so our work carries the same weight with a foreign parent, a </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">lender,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> or an investor as it does with the Egyptian Tax Authority</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>International tax expertise:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">We bring hands-on experience in double tax treaties, transfer </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">pricing,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and cross-border structuring, aligned with OECD standards, to investors entering Egypt and to groups operating across borders.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42);\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Partner-led, team-delivered:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Every engagement is led by a partner and supported by a dedicated team from the initial consultation to the final deliverable, with no handoffs between departments. Clients benefit from senior-level judgement, </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">continuity,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> and accountability at every stage.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 0cm 5pt 18pt; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38);\\"><strong>Digital by design:</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Our services are delivered through a digital-first model. Clients can securely share documents through our client portal, track engagement progress, and connect with our team through virtual meetings, making it possible to work with us seamlessly from anywhere in the world.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 137%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 137%; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Questions investors ask</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>What is the corporate income tax rate in Egypt?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">The standard rate is 22.5% of taxable profit. Different rates apply to certain entities, such as companies in oil exploration and production, and smaller businesses may qualify for the simplified tax regime</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>When is the annual corporate tax return due?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">Within four months of the financial year end. For a company with a 31 December </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">year-end,</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> that means by 30 April</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>Are foreign-owned companies taxed differently from Egyptian companies?</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 125%;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">No. A company incorporated in Egypt is taxed on the same </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\">basis as</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69);\\"> whoever owns it. What changes the tax position is the investment regime it operates under, such as a free zone or an economic zone.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Playfair Display&quot;;\\">Talk to us about your corporate tax and VAT position.</span></p>","fullDescriptionAr":"<p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الضرائب المباشرة وغير المباشرة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(74, 85, 102); font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إقرارات دقيقة تُقدَّم في مواعيدها، مع توثيق كل موقف قبل أن تطلبه مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الالتزام أصبح رقمياً، وكذلك الرقابة</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">بموجب قانون الإجراءات الضريبية الموحد رقم 206 لسنة 2020، تمر الإقرارات والفواتير والمدفوعات عبر المنظومات الإلكترونية لمصلحة الضرائب المصرية، وأصبح بإمكان المصلحة مطابقة إقراراتك مع البيانات التي يقدّمها عملاؤك وموردوك.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أصبحت الفروق البسيطة بين إقرار القيمة المضافة والفواتير الإلكترونية وإقرار ضريبة الشركات سبباً شائعاً لاختيار الشركة للفحص. وبالنسبة للشركات المملوكة لأجانب تكون المخاطر أعلى، إذ تنعكس التكلفة الضريبية مباشرة على النتائج المرفوعة للشركة الأم وعلى السيولة المتاحة لتوزيع الأرباح.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">كيف نساعدك</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضريبة الدخل على الشركات: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد الإقرار السنوي وتقديمه وفق قانون الضريبة على الدخل رقم 91 لسنة 2005، وحساب الربح الخاضع للضريبة، ومراجعة التكاليف والمخصصات واجبة الخصم، والتخطيط للاستفادة من الخسائر المرحّلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضريبة القيمة المضافة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">التسجيل، والإقرارات الشهرية وفق قانون الضريبة على القيمة المضافة رقم 67 لسنة 2016، واسترداد ضريبة المدخلات، ومعاملة التوريدات المعفاة والخاضعة لسعر الصفر والتصديرية، وضريبة الجدول على السلع والخدمات الواردة به.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضريبة الخصم والتحصيل: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">النماذج الربع سنوية وفق نظام الخصم والتحصيل تحت حساب الضريبة، والخصم على المدفوعات لغير المقيمين، مع مطابقات تدعم الأرصدة الدائنة التي تطالب بها.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ضريبة الدمغة: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">احتساب ضريبة الدمغة على العقود والإعلانات والتسهيلات المصرفية وغيرها من المحررات الخاضعة وفق قانون ضريبة الدمغة رقم 111 لسنة 1980.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الفحص الوقائي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة السنوات الضريبية المفتوحة لتحديد المخاطر ومعالجتها قبل أن يكتشفها فحص المصلحة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التقويم الضريبي: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">جدول موحّد لكل مواعيد الإقرارات والسداد، نتولى مسؤوليته ونشاركه مع فريقك المالي، فلا يعتمد شيء على الذاكرة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">منهجيتنا</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ١</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التشخيص</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">مراجعة الإقرارات والسجلات المحاسبية وبيانات الفواتير الإلكترونية عن السنوات المفتوحة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٢</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>التصحيح</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">سد الفجوات وتوثيق المواقف المتخذة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٣</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>تقديم الإقرارات</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">إعداد الإقرارات وتقديمها خلال المواعيد القانونية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>الخطوة ٤</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>·</strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 133%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>المتابعة</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">متابعة تغيّرات التشريع وممارسات مصلحة الضرائب، وشرح أثر كل منها عليك.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>من نخدم</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 7pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">الشركات المصرية التابعة لمجموعات أجنبية، والشركات العائلية والمدعومة من مستثمرين، والمستثمرون الأجانب في سنوات عملهم الأولى في مصر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لماذا شريف يسري؟</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>محاسبون ومستشارون مرخّصون: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يضم فريقنا محاسبين مرخّصين ومراقبي حسابات مقيدين وخبراء ضرائب معتمدين، بخبرة مهنية تتجاوز عقدين في السوق المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>معايير دولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نعمل وفق المعايير الدولية للتقارير المالية ومعايير المراجعة الدولية إلى جانب المعايير المصرية، ليحظى عملنا بالثقة ذاتها لدى الشركة الأم الأجنبية أو جهة التمويل أو المستثمر كما لدى مصلحة الضرائب المصرية.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>خبرة في الضرائب الدولية: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خبرة عملية في اتفاقيات تجنب الازدواج الضريبي والتسعير التحويلي والهيكلة العابرة للحدود، وفق معايير منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية، للمستثمرين الوافدين إلى مصر وللمجموعات العاملة عبر الحدود.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>بقيادة شريك وتنفيذ فريق: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">يقود كل تكليف شريك يدعمه فريق مخصّص من الاستشارة الأولى حتى التسليم النهائي، دون تنقّل بين الإدارات. ويحظى العملاء برأي مهني رفيع واستمرارية ومساءلة في كل مرحلة.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 0cm 18pt 5pt 0cm; text-indent: -12pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">•</span><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>رقمية بالتصميم: </strong></span><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">نقدّم خدماتنا وفق نموذج رقمي أولاً؛ إذ يمكن للعملاء مشاركة المستندات بأمان عبر بوابة العملاء، ومتابعة سير التكليف، والتواصل مع فريقنا عبر الاجتماعات الافتراضية، بما يتيح العمل معنا بسلاسة من أي مكان في العالم.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin: 12pt 0cm 6pt; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(140, 106, 42); font-size: 18pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">أسئلة المستثمرين</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>ما سعر ضريبة الدخل على الشركات في مصر؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">السعر العام 22.5% من الربح الخاضع للضريبة. وتُطبَّق أسعار مختلفة على بعض الجهات، مثل شركات البحث عن البترول وإنتاجه، وقد تستفيد المشروعات الأصغر من النظام الضريبي المبسّط.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>متى يُستحق تقديم الإقرار الضريبي السنوي للشركات؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">خلال أربعة أشهر من انتهاء السنة المالية. أي بحلول 30 أبريل للشركة التي تنتهي سنتها المالية في 31 ديسمبر.</span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 2pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\"><strong>هل تخضع الشركات المملوكة لأجانب لمعاملة ضريبية مختلفة عن الشركات المصرية؟</strong></span></p><p style=\\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 133%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\"><span style=\\"color: rgb(43, 53, 69); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">لا. تخضع الشركة المؤسسة في مصر للضريبة على الأساس ذاته أياً كان مالكها. ما يغيّر الموقف الضريبي هو نظام الاستثمار الذي تعمل في ظله، كالمنطقة الحرة أو المنطقة الاقتصادية.</span></p><p><span style=\\"color: rgb(11, 23, 38); font-size: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\\">تحدث معنا عن موقفك من ضريبة الشركات والقيمة المضافة.</span></p>","image":null,"imageId":null}}', '["bodyAr","metadata"]', 'cadmini0o95r2vx5mux5f59q', '2026-10-06 12:12:57.703');
